1
00:02:14,876 --> 00:02:20,251
<i>How many times have I told you? This is the third phone you've destroyed! What more do you want?</i>

2
00:02:20,792 --> 00:02:27,251
<i>Eat this! Aren't you hungry? Drink some water.
How many times must I tell you, my child?</i>

3
00:02:28,167 --> 00:02:31,792
<i>Why can you not understand?
Am I not saying this for your own good?</i>

4
00:02:35,084 --> 00:02:38,292
<i>Here, eat! I can only go to work once you've eaten!</i>

5
00:02:40,001 --> 00:02:45,792
<i>What is all this? So many messages coming in!</i>

6
00:03:45,334 --> 00:03:48,583
<i>"That's what we do when the city is awake,"</i>

7
00:03:48,584 --> 00:03:51,292
<i>"as we wait for that late-night call."</i>

8
00:03:51,417 --> 00:03:54,250
<i>"We play the signal like the song of
the bow and wait for it!"</i>

9
00:03:54,251 --> 00:03:57,458
<i>"Names change fast, same old turtle."</i>

10
00:03:57,459 --> 00:03:58,958
<i>"Lots of games here to play."</i>

11
00:03:58,959 --> 00:04:00,001
<i>"Haha, that's how we roll."</i>

12
00:04:00,709 --> 00:04:01,459
<i>"Haha."</i>

13
00:04:02,126 --> 00:04:03,167
<i>"That's how we roll."</i>

14
00:04:04,626 --> 00:04:05,667
<i>"That's how we roll."</i>

15
00:04:06,501 --> 00:04:07,709
<i>"The mind walks with a grade, sparkling like light!"</i>

16
00:04:08,334 --> 00:04:09,751
<i>"We sing the chorus, go!"</i>

17
00:04:10,001 --> 00:04:12,959
<i>"Call it fun! We call it time!"</i>

18
00:04:13,292 --> 00:04:13,958
<i>"Now, it drops in."</i>

19
00:04:13,959 --> 00:04:14,958
<i>"Let's roll the lights."</i>

20
00:04:14,959 --> 00:04:19,666
<i>"They say move fast, don't stay too long! We did just that!"</i>

21
00:04:19,667 --> 00:04:22,833
<i>"Now sing along! Along with us, no speed limit signs!"</i>

22
00:04:22,834 --> 00:04:25,084
<i>"We clap to the roof just to deliver this in disguise!"</i>

23
00:04:25,334 --> 00:04:27,251
<i>"Lots of fun! Everyone, read the fine print!"</i>

24
00:04:40,251 --> 00:04:41,542
<i>"Or read between the lines!"</i>

25
00:05:04,542 --> 00:05:04,917
<i>Mother!</i>

26
00:05:05,792 --> 00:05:11,417
<i>Hello, Achhu. Have you had enough of the city? Are you ready to come back home?</i>

27
00:05:12,334 --> 00:05:13,001
<i>I am coming, Mom.</i>

28
00:05:14,251 --> 00:05:20,709
<i>What has happened to her? Dikshit!</i>

29
00:05:21,084 --> 00:05:22,084
<i>Yes, Auntie! Tell me!</i>

30
00:05:22,459 --> 00:05:25,042
<i>It seems our Achhu wants to come back home.</i>

31
00:05:25,917 --> 00:05:27,834
<i>She will reach home tomorrow morning, Auntie.</i>

32
00:05:42,667 --> 00:05:43,376
<i>Mr. Kurup,</i>

33
00:05:43,501 --> 00:05:43,959
<i>Pranav.</i>

34
00:05:44,167 --> 00:05:48,084
<i>I mean, what did you and your boys do to that poor girl?</i>

35
00:05:48,626 --> 00:05:53,292
<i>I don't know. I was calling them, but I have no idea where they are.</i>

36
00:05:53,459 --> 00:05:57,334
<i>Look! She took all her things and left.</i>

37
00:05:57,501 --> 00:05:58,334
<i>Where to?</i>

38
00:05:58,667 --> 00:06:01,042
<i>Hmm, I think she went home.</i>

39
00:06:02,376 --> 00:06:03,292
<i>Oh, no!</i>

40
00:06:06,709 --> 00:06:10,709
<i>Why don't you call them, check where they are, and what they're doing?</i>

41
00:06:10,876 --> 00:06:12,042
<i>Okay.</i>

42
00:06:13,251 --> 00:06:15,251
<i>I know about their games.</i>

43
00:06:15,376 --> 00:06:16,000
<i>I'll check, alright.</i>

44
00:06:16,001 --> 00:06:16,584
<i>Quickly.</i>

45
00:06:16,709 --> 00:06:16,959
<i>Yeah.</i>

46
00:06:21,501 --> 00:06:29,876
<i>Hey Sunil, don't worry about the police following you. Just go the way I told you; I'll handle the rest.</i>

47
00:06:46,792 --> 00:06:47,126
<i>Hello.</i>

48
00:06:47,959 --> 00:06:52,209
<i>Sir, of the 7 grievances, 6 are anonymous. The seventh one...</i>

49
00:06:52,334 --> 00:06:53,501
<i>Arrange a meeting with them.</i>

50
00:06:53,667 --> 00:06:54,209
<i>Okay, Sir.</i>

51
00:06:54,626 --> 00:06:56,959
<i>And send Achyutha's project report to my cabin.</i>

52
00:06:57,167 --> 00:06:58,625
<i>Can I send it in the evening, Sir?</i>

53
00:06:58,626 --> 00:06:58,959
<i>Yeah.</i>

54
00:06:59,167 --> 00:06:59,583
<i>Yes, Sir.</i>

55
00:06:59,584 --> 00:07:00,084
<i>Hmm.</i>

56
00:07:54,792 --> 00:07:59,542
<i>Everyone from the village goes to the city to achieve their dreams.</i>

57
00:08:00,459 --> 00:08:05,209
<i>But my story is not like that.</i>

58
00:08:06,084 --> 00:08:12,584
<i>Since childhood, I realized my path was not the same as everyone else's.</i>

59
00:08:13,376 --> 00:08:20,792
<i>The memories and fears were all inside me. My story does not start the usual way.</i>

60
00:08:21,834 --> 00:08:24,459
<i>I returned from the city to the village.</i>

61
00:08:25,917 --> 00:08:30,376
<i>To save my dreams and to achieve them.</i>

62
00:12:26,126 --> 00:12:27,667
<i>Who is it now?</i>

63
00:12:34,209 --> 00:12:34,709
<i>Hello.</i>

64
00:12:35,459 --> 00:12:36,709
<i>Hello, Achu.</i>

65
00:12:37,251 --> 00:12:39,376
<i>What's up, Mom? Please tell me quickly, I have work here.</i>

66
00:12:39,876 --> 00:12:41,126
<i>Achu.</i>

67
00:12:41,459 --> 00:12:45,042
<i>What is it, Mom? Mom, speak clearly. What's the problem?</i>

68
00:12:47,126 --> 00:12:48,959
<i>Achu, our Vishnu...</i>

69
00:12:50,001 --> 00:12:52,459
<i>Can you hear me? Hello?</i>

70
00:12:54,667 --> 00:12:56,876
<i>Achhu, our Vishnu...</i>

71
00:12:57,959 --> 00:13:01,501
<i>Vishnu? Hello, what happened to Vishnu?</i>

72
00:13:04,042 --> 00:13:07,584
<i>Achu, our Vishnu slipped and fell into the river!</i>

73
00:13:09,626 --> 00:13:12,626
<i>Hello? Mom! Hello!</i>

74
00:13:21,042 --> 00:13:22,334
<i>Hello, Mom! What happened to Vishnu?</i>

75
00:13:32,251 --> 00:13:37,501
<i>His mom was serving him food.</i>

76
00:13:39,667 --> 00:13:42,876
<i>That's when he slipped and fell into the river.</i>

77
00:13:51,876 --> 00:13:54,626
<i>Hello, hello!</i>

78
00:13:59,417 --> 00:14:05,542
<i>Achu... Achu... Achhu, hello. Achu...</i>

79
00:16:47,959 --> 00:16:51,166
<i>I rise from the dark
where the gods once stayed.</i>

80
00:16:51,167 --> 00:16:53,958
<i>Shadows break open
where her footsteps played.</i>

81
00:16:53,959 --> 00:16:56,166
<i>Light in the ruins,
fire in her frame.</i>

82
00:16:56,167 --> 00:16:59,250
<i>Every heartbeat
calling out Vishnu's name.</i>

83
00:16:59,251 --> 00:17:01,666
<i>Storm in the silence,
thunder in the bones.</i>

84
00:17:01,667 --> 00:17:04,750
<i>She is the dancer,
walking through unknowns.</i>

85
00:17:04,751 --> 00:17:07,083
<i>Fear became rhythm,
destiny chose to stay.</i>

86
00:17:07,084 --> 00:17:10,458
<i>Black and youthful,
breathing through a broken ray.</i>

87
00:17:10,459 --> 00:17:13,541
<i>In a dark room,
a dancer stood with three gods.</i>

88
00:17:13,542 --> 00:17:16,333
<i>Her footsteps shook
the silence into light.</i>

89
00:17:16,334 --> 00:17:18,541
<i>A girl who danced
for heaven...</i>

90
00:17:18,542 --> 00:17:21,959
<i>I knew...
hell was calling her name.</i>

91
00:17:22,876 --> 00:17:25,416
<i>In the river of gods,
I lost my soul.</i>

92
00:17:25,417 --> 00:17:28,750
<i>In the fire of grief,
I found my role.</i>

93
00:17:28,751 --> 00:17:31,500
<i>Every tear I shed
became control.</i>

94
00:17:31,501 --> 00:17:34,583
<i>Now I dance
to heal the broken whole.</i>

95
00:17:34,584 --> 00:17:37,458
<i>I rose from the dark
where the gods inhale.</i>

96
00:17:37,459 --> 00:17:40,291
<i>When a dancer breaks,
even thunder pales.</i>

97
00:17:40,292 --> 00:17:42,958
<i>I carve my path
with a broken nail.</i>

98
00:17:42,959 --> 00:17:45,333
<i>Pain is the ship,
and I'm the sail.</i>

99
00:17:45,334 --> 00:17:48,291
<i>A scam struck a child
like a serpent's kiss.</i>

100
00:17:48,292 --> 00:17:50,875
<i>One wrong click,
into death's abyss.</i>

101
00:17:50,876 --> 00:17:53,708
<i>He stepped back once,
the river claimed him.</i>

102
00:17:53,709 --> 00:17:56,333
<i>A dream drowned early
by the world's neglect.</i>

103
00:17:56,334 --> 00:17:58,958
<i>The same cursed link
lit up my phone.</i>

104
00:17:58,959 --> 00:18:01,791
<i>The same silent scream
cut through my bones.</i>

105
00:18:01,792 --> 00:18:04,541
<i>Savings were gone,
but I wasn't alone.</i>

106
00:18:04,542 --> 00:18:07,833
<i>Rage became my kingdom,
pain became my throne.</i>

107
00:18:07,834 --> 00:18:10,916
<i>I type with thunder,
coded with grief.</i>

108
00:18:10,917 --> 00:18:13,416
<i>Turned every second
into belief.</i>

109
00:18:13,417 --> 00:18:16,041
<i>Built a shield
against the thieves.</i>

110
00:18:16,042 --> 00:18:18,625
<i>Sanchar Setu—
a gateway of divine relief.</i>

111
00:18:18,626 --> 00:18:21,666
<i>They stole my flame,
but not my fire.</i>

112
00:18:21,667 --> 00:18:24,375
<i>They stole my name,
not my desire.</i>

113
00:18:24,376 --> 00:18:27,709
<i>Thieves may climb,
but never higher.</i>

114
00:18:28,376 --> 00:18:31,166
<i>I walk with gods;
they burn in shame.</i>

115
00:18:31,167 --> 00:18:33,916
<i>Ledger of truth,
coded in flame.</i>

116
00:18:33,917 --> 00:18:36,750
<i>Chaos bowed low
when it heard my name.</i>

117
00:18:36,751 --> 00:18:39,291
<i>Scammers' empires
fell in shame.</i>

118
00:18:39,292 --> 00:18:42,250
<i>I became war,
yet remained the same.</i>

119
00:18:42,251 --> 00:18:45,041
<i>Back to the soil
where childhood slept.</i>

120
00:18:45,042 --> 00:18:47,416
<i>Back to the home
where memories wept.</i>

121
00:18:47,417 --> 00:18:49,041
<i>But the dance
never left my feet.</i>

122
00:18:49,042 --> 00:18:50,875
<i>gone, just kept</i>

123
00:18:50,876 --> 00:18:53,876
<i>By the river
that stole my little one.</i>

124
00:18:54,126 --> 00:18:58,375
<i>I drove my faith
like a setting sun.</i>

125
00:18:58,376 --> 00:19:00,708
<i>Devotion faded,
hope undone.</i>

126
00:19:00,709 --> 00:19:02,250
<i>Every last word
became someone.</i>

127
00:19:02,251 --> 00:19:04,458
<i>When idols drown
the truth with lies...</i>

128
00:19:04,459 --> 00:19:07,291
<i>When tears fall,
the storm replies.</i>

129
00:19:07,292 --> 00:19:10,000
<i>I saw my soul
with open eyes.</i>

130
00:19:10,001 --> 00:19:13,541
<i>Achyutha rose,
divinity crystallised.</i>

131
00:19:13,542 --> 00:19:16,250
<i>Now I run with lightning,
breathe with storm.</i>

132
00:19:16,251 --> 00:19:19,000
<i>Reborn in fire,
a divine new form.</i>

133
00:19:19,001 --> 00:19:21,333
<i>I broke their chains
and the scammers' swarm.</i>

134
00:19:21,334 --> 00:19:24,583
<i>Achyutha, I rise
as the world transforms.</i>

135
00:19:24,584 --> 00:19:27,250
<i>I'm the cosmic coder,
carving carnage in cadence.</i>

136
00:19:27,251 --> 00:19:30,125
<i>Breaking every barrier
with god-level radiance.</i>

137
00:19:30,126 --> 00:19:32,875
<i>River in my memory,
fire in my legacy.</i>

138
00:19:32,876 --> 00:19:36,126
<i>Achyutha, the avatar
rewriting destiny.</i>

139
00:19:36,376 --> 00:19:40,251
<i>In the river of gods,</i>

140
00:20:12,709 --> 00:20:20,001
<i>Yes, Achhu has come! Achhu! Has anyone told her that my son is gone?</i>

141
00:20:20,917 --> 00:20:24,209
<i>Does she know? Would someone have told her?</i>

142
00:20:34,667 --> 00:20:36,834
<i>Achhu! What a mess you are!</i>

143
00:20:37,251 --> 00:20:38,625
<i>How many days has it been since you slept?</i>

144
00:20:38,626 --> 00:20:39,501
<i>Give her some water!</i>

145
00:20:39,709 --> 00:20:41,251
<i>Did you eat something on the way?</i>

146
00:20:42,126 --> 00:20:47,209
<i>Achhu, I am asking you. Achhu, didn't you hear me? Achhu!</i>

147
00:21:28,292 --> 00:21:28,917
<i>Achyuth.</i>

148
00:21:29,126 --> 00:21:29,791
<i>Hmm.</i>

149
00:21:29,792 --> 00:21:30,792
<i>Where did you go?</i>

150
00:21:31,292 --> 00:21:34,416
<i>Sister, I had to undergo a verification.</i>

151
00:21:34,417 --> 00:21:38,666
<i>And on the way back, I stopped to make
some photocopies and visited the temple.</i>

152
00:21:38,667 --> 00:21:42,376
<i>Yes, Achhu, someone else
took a SIM in my name.</i>

153
00:21:42,542 --> 00:21:46,959
<i>I blocked it using your SancharaSetu app.</i>

154
00:22:05,376 --> 00:22:08,542
<i>Even though you have shifted all
his business to Bangalore...</i>

155
00:22:09,376 --> 00:22:13,251
<i>We still have some old dues to collect,
right, Sir?</i>

156
00:22:13,667 --> 00:22:15,501
<i>Did you forget?</i>

157
00:22:15,626 --> 00:22:16,666
<i>Please let go of all that!</i>

158
00:22:16,667 --> 00:22:18,000
<i>Can I just let it go like that, Sir?</i>

159
00:22:18,001 --> 00:22:19,376
<i>Yes. You have come!</i>

160
00:22:19,834 --> 00:22:20,584
<i>Hello, Sir.</i>

161
00:22:23,667 --> 00:22:24,542
<i>Hmm.</i>

162
00:22:28,876 --> 00:22:31,417
<i>Sir, any updates on my project?</i>

163
00:22:34,501 --> 00:22:36,542
<i>Yes, I reviewed your project.</i>

164
00:22:37,459 --> 00:22:39,333
<i>Your app can be used only</i>

165
00:22:39,334 --> 00:22:43,167
<i>if you collaborate with the government
and their database.</i>

166
00:22:45,084 --> 00:22:46,292
<i>Otherwise, it won't work.</i>

167
00:22:47,626 --> 00:22:48,501
<i>Eh!</i>

168
00:22:53,417 --> 00:22:57,667
<i>Didn't you mention over the
phone that your father was in Dubai?</i>

169
00:22:58,334 --> 00:23:00,792
<i>Yes, Sir.</i>

170
00:23:00,959 --> 00:23:02,751
<i>Tell you what... Send me that file.</i>

171
00:23:03,209 --> 00:23:07,084
<i>To work with the database,
there are some government regulations.</i>

172
00:23:07,292 --> 00:23:09,166
<i>Since your father was in Dubai,</i>

173
00:23:09,167 --> 00:23:13,166
<i>you will have to get a police
clearance certificate quickly.</i>

174
00:23:13,167 --> 00:23:14,501
<i>We can look into the rest later.</i>

175
00:23:15,376 --> 00:23:21,167
<i>Sir, I need to think about this,
but thank you anyway.</i>

176
00:23:31,626 --> 00:23:37,792
<i>Kurup, if you clear my old dues,
I'll get the project from her.</i>

177
00:23:38,251 --> 00:23:40,667
<i>Okay. Do something!</i>

178
00:23:44,959 --> 00:23:51,667
<i>I hope no other child goes through
what my child went through, my dear.</i>

179
00:24:06,584 --> 00:24:09,126
<i>Auntie, that application is not mine.</i>

180
00:24:09,667 --> 00:24:10,459
<i>It's the government's.</i>

181
00:24:55,251 --> 00:24:56,209
<i>Hmm.</i>

182
00:25:07,126 --> 00:25:08,126
<i>Hello.</i>

183
00:25:08,709 --> 00:25:09,500
<i>Hello.</i>

184
00:25:09,501 --> 00:25:10,501
<i>Isn't this Achyutha?</i>

185
00:25:10,626 --> 00:25:11,458
<i>Yes, Sir.</i>

186
00:25:11,459 --> 00:25:13,541
<i>This is the SHO speaking.</i>

187
00:25:13,542 --> 00:25:14,626
<i>Yes, I know, Sir. Please tell me.</i>

188
00:25:14,834 --> 00:25:17,875
<i>There are a few clarifications
needed on the document you submitted;</i>

189
00:25:17,876 --> 00:25:19,167
<i>that's why I called.</i>

190
00:25:19,292 --> 00:25:20,459
<i>What do you need to know, Sir?</i>

191
00:25:20,834 --> 00:25:24,417
<i>Your birth certificate
shows you were born in Bombay.</i>

192
00:25:24,959 --> 00:25:27,834
<i>Yes, Sir,
I was born at Lokamanya Hospital.</i>

193
00:25:28,834 --> 00:25:29,792
<i>Hello.</i>

194
00:25:30,167 --> 00:25:31,501
<i>Hello.</i>

195
00:25:32,251 --> 00:25:32,958
<i>Hello.</i>

196
00:25:32,959 --> 00:25:34,750
<i>Hello, hello, can you hear me, Sir?</i>

197
00:25:34,751 --> 00:25:36,541
<i>Ah, yes, I can hear you now.</i>

198
00:25:36,542 --> 00:25:37,542
<i>Yes, please tell me, Sir.</i>

199
00:25:38,792 --> 00:25:41,459
<i>Did your father work in Dubai?</i>

200
00:25:41,751 --> 00:25:42,626
<i>Yes, Sir.</i>

201
00:25:42,751 --> 00:25:44,166
<i>What was his job?</i>

202
00:25:44,167 --> 00:25:46,042
<i>My father was a driver.</i>

203
00:25:46,167 --> 00:25:50,042
<i>Your school certificate shows
you studied in a government school.</i>

204
00:25:50,417 --> 00:25:53,750
<i>Sir, that's because
all of my father's earnings were enough</i>

205
00:25:53,751 --> 00:25:58,292
<i>only to help his friends and family.</i>

206
00:25:58,626 --> 00:26:01,001
<i>So, what was the reason for your
returning from Mumbai to your hometown?</i>

207
00:26:01,334 --> 00:26:02,709
<i>Sir, that's...</i>

208
00:26:04,084 --> 00:26:04,709
<i>Hello.</i>

209
00:26:06,126 --> 00:26:07,167
<i>Hello.</i>

210
00:27:35,167 --> 00:27:36,042
<i>Hello.</i>

211
00:27:37,209 --> 00:27:38,417
<i>Hello, Sir, can you hear me?</i>

212
00:27:38,626 --> 00:27:39,542
<i>Yes, tell me.</i>

213
00:27:39,917 --> 00:27:42,209
<i>Sir, what happened to the project?</i>

214
00:27:43,001 --> 00:27:46,751
<i>Even after giving you the app
and the trial version you asked for,</i>

215
00:27:47,209 --> 00:27:49,959
<i>why haven't you
sent me the certificate yet?</i>

216
00:27:50,459 --> 00:27:52,626
<i>Or are you waiting to
issue the certificate to me</i>

217
00:27:52,792 --> 00:27:56,167
<i>only after someone else steals my project
design and registers the patent?</i>

218
00:27:57,292 --> 00:28:00,959
<i>Ah, that document is ready,
you can collect it this evening, okay?</i>

219
00:28:01,959 --> 00:28:04,834
<i>Sir, but please consider my situation.</i>

220
00:28:09,251 --> 00:28:09,917
<i>Hello.</i>

221
00:29:11,626 --> 00:29:12,542
<i>Hello.</i>

222
00:29:12,709 --> 00:29:13,625
<i>Why did you disconnect the call?</i>

223
00:29:13,626 --> 00:29:15,626
<i>Hello, Sir, sorry. Please, tell me, Sir.</i>

224
00:29:16,667 --> 00:29:20,292
<i>And again, the reason for shifting
from Mumbai to your hometown?</i>

225
00:29:20,792 --> 00:29:26,959
<i>Sir, after helping everyone there, we came
here to find some support for ourselves.</i>

226
00:29:27,834 --> 00:29:31,459
<i>See, according to the
cyber complaint you filed...</i>

227
00:29:31,751 --> 00:29:32,876
<i>Yes.</i>

228
00:29:33,084 --> 00:29:36,251
<i>It says that six months ago,
a duplicate of your SIM was taken,</i>

229
00:29:36,834 --> 00:29:40,251
<i>and then it was used to log
into your bank account</i>

230
00:29:40,626 --> 00:29:43,292
<i>and transfer the entire loan amount.</i>

231
00:29:43,542 --> 00:29:44,459
<i>Yes, Sir.</i>

232
00:29:44,709 --> 00:29:47,542
<i>And it also says your family
should not be informed about this.</i>

233
00:29:48,542 --> 00:29:49,459
<i>Is all of this true?</i>

234
00:29:49,584 --> 00:29:52,375
<i>Yes, Sir, is there any
update on that complaint?</i>

235
00:29:52,376 --> 00:29:54,792
<i>Um... no.</i>

236
00:29:55,917 --> 00:29:57,541
<i>So far, there's no update.</i>

237
00:29:57,542 --> 00:30:01,916
<i>See, the issue is whether
the complaint you filed</i>

238
00:30:01,917 --> 00:30:05,751
<i>will be an obstacle to filing a report.</i>

239
00:30:06,501 --> 00:30:09,375
<i>Sir, what are you saying?
I am the victim in that case.</i>

240
00:30:09,376 --> 00:30:12,251
<i>If I were the culprit,
you could suspect that.</i>

241
00:30:13,584 --> 00:30:15,917
<i>I need to discuss this with my seniors</i>

242
00:30:16,584 --> 00:30:18,626
<i>and then we can immediately
file the report, okay?</i>

243
00:30:19,167 --> 00:30:20,751
<i>Ah, okay, Sir.</i>

244
00:31:07,001 --> 00:31:07,958
<i>Has your daughter come?</i>

245
00:31:07,959 --> 00:31:10,626
<i>Best, what are you doing here
instead of picking coconuts?</i>

246
00:31:10,751 --> 00:31:13,750
<i>Master dropped this letter.
You came when I was picking it up.</i>

247
00:31:13,751 --> 00:31:15,459
<i>All right, hold this for a moment,
I'll check.</i>

248
00:31:15,584 --> 00:31:17,292
<i>Oh, no! Your hand is all dirty.</i>

249
00:31:17,626 --> 00:31:19,291
<i>Come on,
don't make me angry unnecessarily;</i>

250
00:31:19,292 --> 00:31:20,292
<i>just put it in the bag!</i>

251
00:31:20,834 --> 00:31:22,751
<i>I will give it if you tell me
about the result of this!</i>

252
00:31:23,084 --> 00:31:24,709
<i>This person! Dad.</i>

253
00:31:25,126 --> 00:31:25,834
<i>Dad.</i>

254
00:31:26,084 --> 00:31:26,916
<i>What is it?</i>

255
00:31:26,917 --> 00:31:29,876
<i>Hey! Come here, I'll tell you the result.</i>

256
00:31:33,001 --> 00:31:34,084
<i>Oh, God!</i>

257
00:31:53,501 --> 00:31:54,292
<i>Quick!</i>

258
00:32:05,167 --> 00:32:07,667
<i>Come on, pick up the call.</i>

259
00:32:19,584 --> 00:32:20,501
<i>Hmm.</i>

260
00:32:23,667 --> 00:32:24,751
<i>Kurup!</i>

261
00:32:33,667 --> 00:32:34,833
<i>Hello Joseph...</i>

262
00:32:34,834 --> 00:32:36,167
<i>I will send the saplings tomorrow.</i>

263
00:32:36,542 --> 00:32:37,626
<i>Okay, you can send it in the morning.</i>

264
00:32:37,959 --> 00:32:38,917
<i>Oh, all right.</i>

265
00:32:39,126 --> 00:32:40,542
<i>Is the verification all done?</i>

266
00:32:40,917 --> 00:32:42,916
<i>Why do you keep telling everyone
in the village that it is my app?</i>

267
00:32:42,917 --> 00:32:44,501
<i>As if you have no other work.</i>

268
00:32:45,209 --> 00:32:47,750
<i>Didn't you tell me it was yours?</i>

269
00:32:47,751 --> 00:32:52,084
<i>Isn't that why I told the villagers?
Now, is that my fault too?</i>

270
00:32:52,334 --> 00:32:54,501
<i>Hey! Move all this stuff over here.</i>

271
00:32:54,751 --> 00:32:58,084
<i>Not the coconut, put it in one spot!
Yes, right there.</i>

272
00:32:58,209 --> 00:33:01,209
<i>Hey, I am going to have some coffee.
Do you want some?</i>

273
00:33:02,209 --> 00:33:02,876
<i>What?</i>

274
00:33:04,334 --> 00:33:05,000
<i>No.</i>

275
00:33:05,001 --> 00:33:07,042
<i>Okay, if you don't want it, fine.
I want it.</i>

276
00:33:30,084 --> 00:33:31,042
<i>Achhu.</i>

277
00:33:31,251 --> 00:33:33,167
<i>Yes, what?</i>

278
00:33:35,251 --> 00:33:37,208
<i>I have a good business idea.</i>

279
00:33:37,209 --> 00:33:38,501
<i>Tell me.</i>

280
00:33:38,751 --> 00:33:41,917
<i>Our team will come and set
up a tower at the place I tell you,</i>

281
00:33:42,584 --> 00:33:44,917
<i>and they'll also pay
us rent monthly for it.</i>

282
00:33:45,459 --> 00:33:48,958
<i>My friends said they will invest
five million rupees for the place.</i>

283
00:33:48,959 --> 00:33:50,209
<i>Hmm.</i>

284
00:33:50,334 --> 00:33:52,250
<i>I also need to find five million rupees.</i>

285
00:33:52,251 --> 00:33:54,333
<i>That would be for the network
company's deposit,</i>

286
00:33:54,334 --> 00:33:57,292
<i>NOC, commission, and other requirements.</i>

287
00:34:00,709 --> 00:34:04,417
<i>Out of the 200,000 rupees we get monthly,
100,000 rupees is our commission.</i>

288
00:34:06,084 --> 00:34:08,208
<i>I have told them that if you want,
you can clear your loan with it</i>

289
00:34:08,209 --> 00:34:11,959
<i>and invest the remaining
in your project. I mean...</i>

290
00:34:13,542 --> 00:34:14,917
<i>What I am saying is...</i>

291
00:34:15,542 --> 00:34:18,584
<i>Let that wait, but how did your
friends know about my project?</i>

292
00:34:19,834 --> 00:34:20,959
<i>Did you go and tell them something?</i>

293
00:34:21,167 --> 00:34:23,041
<i>Dad said he will give me
2,500 rupees.</i>

294
00:34:23,042 --> 00:34:24,751
<i>Tell me whether you can give it or not!</i>

295
00:34:25,292 --> 00:34:26,166
<i>Hey, just wait!</i>

296
00:34:26,167 --> 00:34:30,126
<i>I believe starting this partnership
could be risky, so don't rush into it.</i>

297
00:34:30,667 --> 00:34:32,876
<i>No, I know what to do.</i>

298
00:34:33,084 --> 00:34:37,376
<i>When I make money with my friends,
you come here, then I'll show you!</i>

299
00:34:39,126 --> 00:34:42,000
<i>Fine, fine.
Let the loan amount get credited first,</i>

300
00:34:42,001 --> 00:34:45,626
<i>then I'll transfer it to you.
That's all I can do.</i>

301
00:34:58,792 --> 00:34:59,834
<i>Here is the coffee.</i>

302
00:35:00,042 --> 00:35:02,876
<i>Yes, I asked Surya to take the coconut,
we need to check if he has left.</i>

303
00:35:03,084 --> 00:35:05,376
<i>Yes, let me check. He might have left.</i>

304
00:35:05,584 --> 00:35:06,417
<i>Mom.</i>

305
00:35:06,542 --> 00:35:07,459
<i>Yes.</i>

306
00:35:07,667 --> 00:35:09,833
<i>How long has it been since
your darling son ran away?</i>

307
00:35:09,834 --> 00:35:12,542
<i>Where is he? What is he doing?
Did you get to know anything?</i>

308
00:35:16,417 --> 00:35:18,667
<i>You have had time only
to say this since then, isn't it?</i>

309
00:35:19,501 --> 00:35:22,459
<i>He will come. Where else would he go?</i>

310
00:35:32,959 --> 00:35:35,042
<i>Ugh, I cannot get through.</i>

311
00:35:59,834 --> 00:36:01,584
<i>Yes.</i>

312
00:36:04,584 --> 00:36:05,375
<i>Hey, Surya.</i>

313
00:36:05,376 --> 00:36:06,334
<i>Oh.</i>

314
00:36:06,542 --> 00:36:07,833
<i>Pick that floating one
and put it over here.</i>

315
00:36:07,834 --> 00:36:08,708
<i>Yes, I will take it.</i>

316
00:36:08,709 --> 00:36:10,042
<i>Hey, there's some at the back too.</i>

317
00:36:10,501 --> 00:36:11,959
<i>Where to look? Here, caught it?</i>

318
00:36:12,542 --> 00:36:14,209
<i>Hey, get the ones lying over there too.</i>

319
00:36:16,626 --> 00:36:17,626
<i>Isn't that Mohan's car!</i>

320
00:36:17,917 --> 00:36:19,709
<i>Uncle, Greetings!</i>

321
00:36:21,376 --> 00:36:24,001
<i>Ah, Satish, how are you?</i>

322
00:36:24,417 --> 00:36:25,501
<i>Yes, I am fine.</i>

323
00:36:26,376 --> 00:36:27,751
<i>When did you come from Bangalore?</i>

324
00:36:28,501 --> 00:36:29,833
<i>I just arrived yesterday.</i>

325
00:36:29,834 --> 00:36:34,042
<i>I bid for Mohan's car online.
I came for its delivery.</i>

326
00:36:34,709 --> 00:36:37,584
<i>All right,
all right, very good, best of luck.</i>

327
00:36:38,501 --> 00:36:39,167
<i>Yes.</i>

328
00:36:39,834 --> 00:36:41,042
<i>Do you need a drop, Uncle?</i>

329
00:36:41,584 --> 00:36:42,959
<i>No, it's all right.</i>

330
00:36:43,376 --> 00:36:44,751
<i>Okay then, Uncle! Bye!</i>

331
00:36:47,167 --> 00:36:48,167
<i>Take care.</i>

332
00:37:13,251 --> 00:37:14,126
<i>Hey, Surya.</i>

333
00:37:14,251 --> 00:37:15,375
<i>Take all those coconuts
and bring them home.</i>

334
00:37:15,376 --> 00:37:16,417
<i>I am coming!</i>

335
00:38:41,459 --> 00:38:43,291
<i>Bring the bill.
- Don't ask for the bill, I want one more!</i>

336
00:38:43,292 --> 00:38:48,709
<i>Yeah, I also need another one! Pour it!
- Give me one puff!</i>

337
00:38:49,209 --> 00:38:50,001
<i>What's up, brother?</i>

338
00:38:50,126 --> 00:38:51,251
<i>Mohan, do you want to smoke?</i>

339
00:38:52,917 --> 00:38:53,916
<i>Okay, take it!</i>

340
00:38:53,917 --> 00:38:55,292
<i>Everything is here.</i>

341
00:38:56,001 --> 00:38:57,876
<i>Hey, did you notice something?</i>

342
00:38:58,126 --> 00:39:00,292
<i>There is a big change in him now.</i>

343
00:39:00,667 --> 00:39:02,251
<i>Isn't there?
- What nonsense!</i>

344
00:39:02,834 --> 00:39:04,334
<i>He has changed a lot.</i>

345
00:39:05,376 --> 00:39:07,001
<i>How has he changed?</i>

346
00:39:07,584 --> 00:39:08,875
<i>What is the change?</i>

347
00:39:08,876 --> 00:39:10,792
<i>In his dressing, right?
- Dressing?</i>

348
00:39:10,959 --> 00:39:14,000
<i>Hey, you stick to this look!
It suits you!</i>

349
00:39:14,001 --> 00:39:15,751
<i>Has the bill come?</i>

350
00:39:19,209 --> 00:39:21,334
<i>Achu, close that thing
and try eating something.</i>

351
00:39:22,251 --> 00:39:24,626
<i>And please, call your Dad.
- Okay, Mom!</i>

352
00:39:26,167 --> 00:39:30,459
<i>Hey!
- Hey! I cannot bear it! Move aside!</i>

353
00:39:30,917 --> 00:39:33,042
<i>I paid the bill in the morning.
Now, you pay.</i>

354
00:39:35,417 --> 00:39:37,750
<i>Come, come, let's go!
- Pay the bill, son!</i>

355
00:39:37,751 --> 00:39:39,291
<i>Pay the bill.
- Are you coming?</i>

356
00:39:39,292 --> 00:39:41,375
<i>No, I'll just visit the washroom
and come, okay?</i>

357
00:39:41,376 --> 00:39:42,042
<i>Come if you want!</i>

358
00:39:43,292 --> 00:39:44,501
<i>Then I'll pay.</i>

359
00:39:45,042 --> 00:39:46,917
<i>Why did you give your card?</i>

360
00:39:47,209 --> 00:39:50,083
<i>Don't you have my dad's card?
- Cards come and go.</i>

361
00:39:50,084 --> 00:39:51,584
<i>Come along, guys!</i>

362
00:39:52,501 --> 00:39:53,751
<i>Yes.</i>

363
00:40:00,542 --> 00:40:02,084
<i>Did Mohan call you?</i>

364
00:40:03,209 --> 00:40:04,833
<i>I have tried calling for the last
two days, but there has been no response.</i>

365
00:40:04,834 --> 00:40:05,792
<i>Oh!</i>

366
00:40:07,751 --> 00:40:09,917
<i>I am the one who gave birth to your son!</i>

367
00:40:10,542 --> 00:40:14,626
<i>I know better than you who and what he is</i>

368
00:40:14,834 --> 00:40:21,292
<i>and what his nature is. So, stop playing
games with me. Do you want some more rice?</i>

369
00:40:21,459 --> 00:40:23,001
<i>No.</i>

370
00:40:33,042 --> 00:40:34,459
<i>Who was that, Dad?</i>

371
00:40:35,001 --> 00:40:36,167
<i>Dad!
- Dad!</i>

372
00:40:37,751 --> 00:40:41,209
<i>Hello, the money you asked for is ready.</i>

373
00:40:41,417 --> 00:40:42,417
<i>Hi, Dad!</i>

374
00:40:42,667 --> 00:40:43,500
<i>When are you coming?</i>

375
00:40:43,501 --> 00:40:45,292
<i>I can come tomorrow, Dad.</i>

376
00:40:45,751 --> 00:40:47,084
<i>When are you going to Dubai?</i>

377
00:40:47,584 --> 00:40:48,876
<i>I'll tell you when I come.</i>

378
00:40:50,542 --> 00:40:51,667
<i>Okay.</i>

379
00:40:53,709 --> 00:40:56,126
<i>How come Dad's name is here?</i>

380
00:41:05,834 --> 00:41:07,042
<i>What did he say?</i>

381
00:41:08,417 --> 00:41:11,666
<i>That he will leave all this
company behind, go to Dubai,</i>

382
00:41:11,667 --> 00:41:13,584
<i>earn money and clear your debts?</i>

383
00:41:14,542 --> 00:41:18,958
<i>Please, I am begging you,
don't burden that girl with all this.</i>

384
00:41:18,959 --> 00:41:21,500
<i>Let us give him one last chance.</i>

385
00:41:21,501 --> 00:41:24,917
<i>How many chances have we given?
Did he succeed even once?</i>

386
00:41:26,209 --> 00:41:32,001
<i>All his friends came here, ate,
and took away the 2.5 million rupees you had.</i>

387
00:41:32,709 --> 00:41:35,209
<i>Did you get even a penny back?</i>

388
00:41:36,042 --> 00:41:37,708
<i>Then, the money that was made in Dubai!</i>

389
00:41:37,709 --> 00:41:40,250
<i>He finished that too!
What does he say when we ask him?</i>

390
00:41:40,251 --> 00:41:42,209
<i>He keeps saying it was a scam!</i>

391
00:41:42,667 --> 00:41:47,667
<i>You also know the law of that land, right?
If there is any trouble,</i>

392
00:41:48,042 --> 00:41:50,416
<i>both father and son should handle it.</i>

393
00:41:50,417 --> 00:41:52,209
<i>Don't drag us into this.</i>

394
00:41:52,584 --> 00:41:55,376
<i>Here, have your medicine.</i>

395
00:41:55,626 --> 00:41:58,667
<i>Either the father should be good,
or the son.</i>

396
00:42:08,251 --> 00:42:09,792
<i>What are you looking at?</i>

397
00:42:10,417 --> 00:42:12,375
<i>Swipe it!
- Go ahead!</i>

398
00:42:12,376 --> 00:42:13,417
<i>It is Father's card, right?</i>

399
00:42:13,792 --> 00:42:15,876
<i>My dear fellow!</i>

400
00:42:16,001 --> 00:42:18,751
<i>He is drunk, okay?
- What is it, kiddo?</i>

401
00:42:19,167 --> 00:42:21,709
<i>Hey, grab a piece of that Alfam for me.
- Don't you need to recall?</i>

402
00:42:22,001 --> 00:42:23,001
<i>Oh, no problem.</i>

403
00:42:23,417 --> 00:42:26,126
<i>Why are you two just staring like this?</i>

404
00:42:26,792 --> 00:42:28,667
<i>It should be nicely broken like this!</i>

405
00:42:28,959 --> 00:42:32,417
<i>Eat it, son, take it and eat, one by one.</i>

406
00:42:33,167 --> 00:42:34,542
<i>Feed him one more.
- Here.</i>

407
00:42:34,709 --> 00:42:37,834
<i>Why are there no fruits in this salad?</i>

408
00:42:38,209 --> 00:42:39,834
<i>Here it is. Take it.</i>

409
00:42:40,792 --> 00:42:41,959
<i>Hello, waiter.</i>

410
00:42:42,251 --> 00:42:43,417
<i>Come.</i>

411
00:42:45,792 --> 00:42:49,209
<i>We developed a signal compression
architecture for rural telecom.</i>

412
00:42:50,292 --> 00:42:53,501
<i>Sir, we received an advertisement
from Kurup's patent company.</i>

413
00:42:53,792 --> 00:42:57,334
<i>It mentioned that a patent
would be granted within 3 months.</i>

414
00:42:58,209 --> 00:43:01,084
<i>So, we contacted him
and verified his license.</i>

415
00:43:01,501 --> 00:43:05,792
<i>We handed over all the files to him
and filed the patent through his company.</i>

416
00:43:06,126 --> 00:43:09,791
<i>On March 11th, the patent office
issued a first examination report notice</i>

417
00:43:09,792 --> 00:43:11,959
<i>to Kurup's registered mail.</i>

418
00:43:13,251 --> 00:43:15,084
<i>He never forwarded it to you.</i>

419
00:43:15,751 --> 00:43:17,666
<i>Did he never call?
- No, Sir.</i>

420
00:43:17,667 --> 00:43:22,375
<i>Did he never file a response
within the 6-month statutory window?</i>

421
00:43:22,376 --> 00:43:23,792
<i>No, Sir.</i>

422
00:43:24,292 --> 00:43:28,084
<i>What was his response
during those 6 months?</i>

423
00:43:29,001 --> 00:43:31,126
<i>He said all compliances
were under control.</i>

424
00:43:31,501 --> 00:43:33,084
<i>In August, when the deadline passed,</i>

425
00:43:33,209 --> 00:43:36,292
<i>our patent application
was deemed abandoned by law.</i>

426
00:43:36,542 --> 00:43:38,126
<i>Not because our idea failed.</i>

427
00:43:38,417 --> 00:43:40,751
<i>Because all the information
was controlled by him.</i>

428
00:43:41,126 --> 00:43:45,209
<i>By the time we found out,
we couldn't do anything legally.</i>

429
00:43:45,834 --> 00:43:48,833
<i>So basically, our idea was stolen.</i>

430
00:43:48,834 --> 00:43:49,709
<i>No.</i>

431
00:43:50,001 --> 00:43:51,167
<i>Ownership was.</i>

432
00:44:11,376 --> 00:44:14,417
<i>Eat, son. Hmm.</i>

433
00:44:17,917 --> 00:44:19,376
<i>What is it?</i>

434
00:44:19,959 --> 00:44:21,334
<i>Every time,</i>

435
00:44:24,626 --> 00:44:26,042
<i>Hmm.</i>

436
00:44:35,292 --> 00:44:36,375
<i>Hello.
- Achyutha?</i>

437
00:44:36,376 --> 00:44:37,166
<i>Yes, Sir.</i>

438
00:44:37,167 --> 00:44:39,583
<i>I have read through your
project report and files.</i>

439
00:44:39,584 --> 00:44:40,458
<i>Tell me, Sir.</i>

440
00:44:40,459 --> 00:44:43,959
<i>I will connect you with the secretary.
Be ready to speak with him.</i>

441
00:44:44,126 --> 00:44:46,626
<i>Um, okay, Sir, I will be ready.</i>

442
00:44:47,751 --> 00:44:48,751
<i>Thank you.</i>

443
00:44:52,709 --> 00:44:54,876
<i>Hey Deva, I called Dikshit.</i>

444
00:44:56,001 --> 00:44:57,417
<i>I couldn't reach him; he seems to be busy.</i>

445
00:44:57,626 --> 00:44:58,709
<i>Mm, mm, mm.</i>

446
00:44:58,959 --> 00:45:01,001
<i>Anyway, you should let him
know what we have learned.</i>

447
00:45:01,376 --> 00:45:02,750
<i>Okay, Brother.
- So, will you take care of it?</i>

448
00:45:02,751 --> 00:45:04,167
<i>Yes, I will take care of it.
- Okay.</i>

449
00:45:04,792 --> 00:45:06,666
<i>I will need to go to the port.</i>

450
00:45:06,667 --> 00:45:07,458
<i>Okay.</i>

451
00:45:07,459 --> 00:45:08,708
<i>The load is supposed to arrive.</i>

452
00:45:08,709 --> 00:45:10,626
<i>It's fine if you go and come back.
- All right.</i>

453
00:45:14,584 --> 00:45:15,208
<i>Okay then, I'll call later.</i>

454
00:45:15,209 --> 00:45:17,041
<i>By the way,
be careful with the pen drive you have.</i>

455
00:45:17,042 --> 00:45:18,334
<i>I'll handle it.
- You go ahead.</i>

456
00:45:18,542 --> 00:45:19,542
<i>All right, then.</i>

457
00:45:30,792 --> 00:45:32,001
<i>Sir!</i>

458
00:45:33,292 --> 00:45:34,292
<i>Sir!</i>

459
00:45:34,751 --> 00:45:36,750
<i>They woke up at 5:30 and left.</i>

460
00:45:36,751 --> 00:45:39,084
<i>Really? Did they leave any cheque?</i>

461
00:45:39,417 --> 00:45:43,666
<i>Don't know, let's check.
Can I get you something to eat?</i>

462
00:45:43,667 --> 00:45:44,626
<i>No need, I ate.</i>

463
00:45:44,751 --> 00:45:45,792
<i>Okay, hmm.</i>

464
00:45:53,334 --> 00:45:54,542
<i>Oh, no!</i>

465
00:46:02,417 --> 00:46:03,334
<i>Um.</i>

466
00:46:03,542 --> 00:46:04,751
<i>Did you call Dad?</i>

467
00:46:05,376 --> 00:46:06,250
<i>Yes, but he did not pick up.</i>

468
00:46:06,251 --> 00:46:07,542
<i>Dad left his mobile here.</i>

469
00:46:07,667 --> 00:46:08,501
<i>Here it is.</i>

470
00:46:08,876 --> 00:46:10,334
<i>All right then.
- Okay.</i>

471
00:46:12,917 --> 00:46:13,958
<i>I believe you are
accountable for it, as well.</i>

472
00:46:13,959 --> 00:46:17,916
<i>See, I am only answerable
to the constitution, to the courts,</i>

473
00:46:17,917 --> 00:46:21,792
<i>and to the parliament. Not to anyone else.
- Sir!</i>

474
00:46:22,501 --> 00:46:24,292
<i>Sir, please read the report.</i>

475
00:46:40,501 --> 00:46:41,750
<i>Ninety-nine point one percent</i>

476
00:46:41,751 --> 00:46:47,667
<i>scam prevention.
What is this LTS?</i>

477
00:46:47,834 --> 00:46:50,334
<i>The founder will explain.
Sir, please talk.</i>

478
00:46:53,792 --> 00:46:54,917
<i>Hello, Sir.</i>

479
00:46:55,501 --> 00:46:59,666
<i>Okay, I have a cabinet meeting,
so make it fast, okay?</i>

480
00:46:59,667 --> 00:47:01,208
<i>Sure, Sir. Sir,</i>

481
00:47:01,209 --> 00:47:08,126
<i>nowadays, children eat only
when mothers hand them a phone.</i>

482
00:47:08,709 --> 00:47:12,834
<i>Now, if a message with a scam
link appears on the phone screen,</i>

483
00:47:13,042 --> 00:47:15,708
<i>and the child taps it unknowingly,</i>

484
00:47:15,709 --> 00:47:19,376
<i>the mother's money, identity,
and everything else could be put at risk.</i>

485
00:47:19,542 --> 00:47:22,167
<i>Okay, what should I do for that?</i>

486
00:47:23,251 --> 00:47:25,459
<i>Sir, the Ledger Transaction System.</i>

487
00:47:25,792 --> 00:47:26,792
<i>That means?</i>

488
00:47:27,209 --> 00:47:29,125
<i>Sir, your hometown is Kasargod, right?</i>

489
00:47:29,126 --> 00:47:32,376
<i>Have you heard the story
of an arrogant officer</i>

490
00:47:32,501 --> 00:47:34,667
<i>who sought forgiveness
from the deity Dhumavati?</i>

491
00:47:35,709 --> 00:47:38,751
<i>Heard of it? I have seen it firsthand.</i>

492
00:47:39,876 --> 00:47:42,500
<i>As soon as he started his job,</i>

493
00:47:42,501 --> 00:47:45,917
<i>he dug a trench to build
a compound around the temple.</i>

494
00:47:46,959 --> 00:47:50,376
<i>By the time he started digging,
his wife got a fever.</i>

495
00:47:51,251 --> 00:47:54,251
<i>He tried various treatments,
but nothing worked.</i>

496
00:47:54,459 --> 00:47:57,541
<i>Eventually, after filling up the trench</i>

497
00:47:57,542 --> 00:48:01,042
<i>and seeking forgiveness,
the fever subsided.</i>

498
00:48:02,167 --> 00:48:05,501
<i>Okay, and what does that
have to do with this project?</i>

499
00:48:06,501 --> 00:48:08,667
<i>What if he hadn't dug that trench?</i>

500
00:48:09,751 --> 00:48:12,001
<i>His wife wouldn't have gotten a fever.</i>

501
00:48:12,667 --> 00:48:17,126
<i>If this kid hadn't received
that scam message while eating...</i>

502
00:48:18,042 --> 00:48:19,833
<i>His mother wouldn't have died.</i>

503
00:48:19,834 --> 00:48:21,083
<i>That is my project, Sir.</i>

504
00:48:21,084 --> 00:48:24,250
<i>The aim of my project is
to prevent these scam messages</i>

505
00:48:24,251 --> 00:48:25,501
<i>from reaching mobile phones.</i>

506
00:48:27,834 --> 00:48:29,917
<i>Building a firewall.
- Yes, Sir.</i>

507
00:48:31,792 --> 00:48:32,917
<i>How?</i>

508
00:48:33,334 --> 00:48:37,501
<i>Sir, who sends all these messages?
How are these messages being sent?</i>

509
00:48:39,167 --> 00:48:42,959
<i>Anyone can buy a message
pack from any telecom operator</i>

510
00:48:43,792 --> 00:48:45,792
<i>and send it to anyone they want.</i>

511
00:48:47,167 --> 00:48:50,625
<i>So, if I buy a pack of one lakh messages,</i>

512
00:48:50,626 --> 00:48:54,166
<i>add a header like PBI Bank, attach a scam,</i>

513
00:48:54,167 --> 00:48:56,166
<i>I can send messages to anyone, right?</i>

514
00:48:56,167 --> 00:49:00,626
<i>But there's no pre-approval,
or filter for this transaction, right?</i>

515
00:49:00,751 --> 00:49:01,876
<i>Yes.</i>

516
00:49:02,084 --> 00:49:04,750
<i>Sir, but if you build
this Ledger Transaction System,</i>

517
00:49:04,751 --> 00:49:09,042
<i>anyone who wants to purchase
messages has to register with our LTS.</i>

518
00:49:10,001 --> 00:49:13,791
<i>For example, imagine I run a bank.</i>

519
00:49:13,792 --> 00:49:14,666
<i>Okay.</i>

520
00:49:14,667 --> 00:49:20,167
<i>Then, when I buy a message pack, I need
to register it before sending it, right?</i>

521
00:49:20,584 --> 00:49:24,291
<i>Yes, Sir. If you register as PBI Bank,</i>

522
00:49:24,292 --> 00:49:28,125
<i>you will get a header like VKPBINS.</i>

523
00:49:28,126 --> 00:49:31,041
<i>Then, you can only
send messages through LTS</i>

524
00:49:31,042 --> 00:49:36,334
<i>after getting pre-approval
for the content.</i>

525
00:49:36,751 --> 00:49:38,750
<i>But what if there is
a difference between the messages</i>

526
00:49:38,751 --> 00:49:41,792
<i>I send and the registered messages?</i>

527
00:49:42,334 --> 00:49:47,666
<i>Sir, even a mismatch of a single letter or
dot will cause LTS to block the message.</i>

528
00:49:47,667 --> 00:49:49,708
<i>And if it finds any suspicious links,</i>

529
00:49:49,709 --> 00:49:51,917
<i>the sender will be
immediately blacklisted, Sir.</i>

530
00:49:52,417 --> 00:49:54,501
<i>What are those suffix letters?</i>

531
00:49:54,834 --> 00:49:57,666
<i>Sir, this LTS suffix system
provides information</i>

532
00:49:57,667 --> 00:50:00,959
<i>about messages to the receivers.</i>

533
00:50:01,084 --> 00:50:04,209
<i>For example, 'T' stands for transaction,</i>

534
00:50:04,334 --> 00:50:08,958
<i>giving information related
to transaction messages.</i>

535
00:50:08,959 --> 00:50:13,250
<i>'P' is for promotional messages
and 'S' is for service-related messages.</i>

536
00:50:13,251 --> 00:50:14,792
<i>And 'G' stands for government, Sir.</i>

537
00:50:15,042 --> 00:50:19,084
<i>But still, scams happen, right?</i>

538
00:50:19,417 --> 00:50:24,084
<i>Sir, in such cases, we can get
a complete transaction map from LTS.</i>

539
00:50:24,251 --> 00:50:27,083
<i>So, we have their entire
information with us.</i>

540
00:50:27,084 --> 00:50:29,708
<i>So wherever and to whomever
they send messages from,</i>

541
00:50:29,709 --> 00:50:33,292
<i>we can immediately detect
and also take immediate action, Sir.</i>

542
00:50:34,709 --> 00:50:37,751
<i>Okay, I will get back to you.</i>

543
00:50:41,334 --> 00:50:42,376
<i>Okay, Sir.</i>

544
00:50:42,834 --> 00:50:43,917
<i>Thank you.</i>

545
00:50:45,292 --> 00:50:49,000
<i>Achu, you have been sitting
since morning, right?</i>

546
00:50:49,001 --> 00:50:51,334
<i>Come and have something to drink at least.</i>

547
00:51:09,792 --> 00:51:13,126
<i>Hey, I'll be back.
Hey, Johnny.</i>

548
00:51:13,751 --> 00:51:15,583
<i>Hey, tell me what happened.
Hey, when will the load come?</i>

549
00:51:15,584 --> 00:51:19,459
<i>Tell me that.
Huh? One minute, one minute.</i>

550
00:51:19,626 --> 00:51:23,001
<i>Hey, guys! Stop playing and go!</i>

551
00:51:23,542 --> 00:51:26,501
<i>Hey, the boat is coming. Go fast, okay?</i>

552
00:51:27,709 --> 00:51:29,501
<i>Hey Johnny, when is the load arriving?</i>

553
00:51:30,834 --> 00:51:32,626
<i>Did the Master come here to buy fish?</i>

554
00:51:33,667 --> 00:51:34,708
<i>Hey, the load should come on time, okay?</i>

555
00:51:34,709 --> 00:51:35,875
<i>Otherwise, things will change!
- Brother!</i>

556
00:51:35,876 --> 00:51:37,709
<i>Brother-in-law! Brother-in-law! Stop!</i>

557
00:51:37,834 --> 00:51:40,208
<i>Yeah, I'll call, I'll call.</i>

558
00:51:40,209 --> 00:51:42,375
<i>Then deliver the goods at the
specified time, okay?</i>

559
00:51:42,376 --> 00:51:43,251
<i>Where are you going?
- Okay.</i>

560
00:51:43,751 --> 00:51:46,792
<i>I am going outside. Yes, the
load is on its way. I'll just go and come.</i>

561
00:51:47,042 --> 00:51:47,959
<i>Really?</i>

562
00:51:48,126 --> 00:51:50,751
<i>Hey, do me a favor,
take this check and cash it.</i>

563
00:51:52,709 --> 00:51:53,125
<i>Okay.</i>

564
00:51:53,126 --> 00:51:54,750
<i>I'll send the location.
Will you send the cash there?</i>

565
00:51:54,751 --> 00:51:56,708
<i>Okay. - All right then.
You go ahead. We'll see you there.</i>

566
00:51:56,709 --> 00:51:57,876
<i>Okay.
Go, go, go.</i>

567
00:51:58,501 --> 00:51:59,709
<i>Okay, man.</i>

568
00:52:20,501 --> 00:52:22,751
<i>Sir, where are you going?</i>

569
00:52:23,751 --> 00:52:25,750
<i>You're going to Sharief's office now,
aren't you?</i>

570
00:52:25,751 --> 00:52:27,250
<i>It was Dikshit who settled
all the debts with interest,</i>

571
00:52:27,251 --> 00:52:30,833
<i>which was 25 lakhs from 60 lakhs</i>

572
00:52:30,834 --> 00:52:32,917
<i>from that Sharief. Did you forget that?</i>

573
00:52:34,376 --> 00:52:37,792
<i>Mohan has agreed to leave all his bad
company, go to Dubai,</i>

574
00:52:37,917 --> 00:52:39,959
<i>and pay off all the
debt that he has incurred.</i>

575
00:52:41,126 --> 00:52:45,626
<i>Sir, how many times have I told
you to tell me if there's anything?</i>

576
00:52:46,709 --> 00:52:47,833
<i>When my father passed away,</i>

577
00:52:47,834 --> 00:52:49,667
<i>the only responsibility
he entrusted to me...</i>

578
00:52:49,792 --> 00:52:51,834
<i>Are you preventing
us from doing even that?</i>

579
00:52:52,792 --> 00:52:55,542
<i>How many times can I trouble you all?</i>

580
00:52:56,376 --> 00:52:57,584
<i>Come on, get in the vehicle, Sir!</i>

581
00:52:57,709 --> 00:52:59,751
<i>You helped us when you were able to,
right? Please get in!</i>

582
00:53:01,042 --> 00:53:02,084
<i>Yes, get in.</i>

583
00:53:08,792 --> 00:53:12,542
<i>Pull, drag, twist here, to the left.</i>

584
00:53:13,459 --> 00:53:16,000
<i>There, right there, right there, here.</i>

585
00:53:16,001 --> 00:53:19,501
<i>Hey, what is that guy doing?
Move it towards that side.</i>

586
00:53:19,709 --> 00:53:20,626
<i>Yes.
- Sir!</i>

587
00:53:21,042 --> 00:53:24,251
<i>Did you or your Sir
ask anyone here for money?</i>

588
00:53:24,876 --> 00:53:25,959
<i>No, Sir.</i>

589
00:53:26,292 --> 00:53:30,958
<i>We have been living with our boss,
Dikshit and his father all this time.</i>

590
00:53:30,959 --> 00:53:34,375
<i>After his father's death, we
have been living on what Dikshit gives us!</i>

591
00:53:34,376 --> 00:53:36,959
<i>So how can we tell
you that we have no money?</i>

592
00:53:37,376 --> 00:53:41,126
<i>Sir, I had sent Dikshit a message
to write that in another account.</i>

593
00:53:41,959 --> 00:53:44,458
<i>Look at this, so many missed calls?</i>

594
00:53:44,459 --> 00:53:46,917
<i>What do I do?
- Sorry, Sir.</i>

595
00:53:47,292 --> 00:53:50,001
<i>All right. 5 lakhs, right?</i>

596
00:53:50,459 --> 00:53:51,376
<i>Yes, Sir.</i>

597
00:53:51,501 --> 00:53:53,750
<i>Hey, bring the cheque book.</i>

598
00:53:53,751 --> 00:53:55,792
<i>Sir, cash would be better.</i>

599
00:53:57,167 --> 00:54:00,708
<i>All right then. I'll call the manager
and tell him. Just collect it from there.</i>

600
00:54:00,709 --> 00:54:03,292
<i>Sir, shall I give
the interest money there?</i>

601
00:54:03,917 --> 00:54:08,875
<i>Sir's 85 lakhs and then
10 lakhs for the patent fee.</i>

602
00:54:08,876 --> 00:54:11,834
<i>Sir, the total interest is 1,90,000.</i>

603
00:54:11,959 --> 00:54:13,458
<i>One lakh means...</i>

604
00:54:13,459 --> 00:54:15,542
<i>What is a patent?
- Sir, I'll tell you.</i>

605
00:54:15,876 --> 00:54:18,792
<i>In that case, you can meet the manager.
I will call and inform him.</i>

606
00:54:19,459 --> 00:54:20,709
<i>Okay, Sir. So, shall we take leave?</i>

607
00:54:21,167 --> 00:54:22,084
<i>Yes, and...</i>

608
00:54:22,292 --> 00:54:27,501
<i>You should call Dikshit and ask
him to be a little less angry with me.</i>

609
00:54:28,459 --> 00:54:31,666
<i>Sir, once the cash arrives,
that will be my first priority, okay?</i>

610
00:54:31,667 --> 00:54:33,084
<i>Okay.</i>

611
00:54:34,751 --> 00:54:36,959
<i>Hey, pull it up and tie it.</i>

612
00:54:37,084 --> 00:54:39,001
<i>What is this patent, Vishnu?</i>

613
00:54:39,251 --> 00:54:40,208
<i>Master,</i>

614
00:54:40,209 --> 00:54:42,876
<i>that boat...
It was designed by your daughter.</i>

615
00:54:43,334 --> 00:54:46,542
<i>It was Dikshit who applied for its
patent and got the certificates.</i>

616
00:54:47,042 --> 00:54:50,042
<i>So, no one is allowed
to make a similar boat.</i>

617
00:54:50,167 --> 00:54:51,917
<i>If they made it?</i>

618
00:54:52,334 --> 00:54:53,751
<i>We can file a case and stop them.</i>

619
00:54:54,626 --> 00:54:56,376
<i>What if someone wants
to make one like that?</i>

620
00:54:56,917 --> 00:54:57,750
<i>They need to get permission.</i>

621
00:54:57,751 --> 00:55:00,334
<i>Otherwise, they have to collaborate
with us to make the boat.</i>

622
00:55:01,209 --> 00:55:03,001
<i>What kind of patent did you get?</i>

623
00:55:03,876 --> 00:55:05,750
<i>Master, forget it, it's a secret.</i>

624
00:55:05,751 --> 00:55:07,917
<i>When the time comes,
your daughter will tell you everything.</i>

625
00:55:08,334 --> 00:55:10,584
<i>Okay, okay. But get the money first,</i>

626
00:55:10,751 --> 00:55:12,834
<i>I'll distribute these
plants and come back, okay?</i>

627
00:55:13,501 --> 00:55:14,542
<i>Hey Master?
- Yes.</i>

628
00:55:14,792 --> 00:55:15,584
<i>The keys?
- Oh.</i>

629
00:55:15,709 --> 00:55:17,334
<i>Please take the bike. Let me take leave.
- Yes, go safely.</i>

630
00:56:07,167 --> 00:56:08,916
<i>Hey, Pranchi! He has come!</i>

631
00:56:08,917 --> 00:56:11,291
<i>I saw him! Hide your face!</i>

632
00:56:11,292 --> 00:56:12,376
<i>Careful, okay?</i>

633
00:56:13,917 --> 00:56:15,126
<i>It's in my hand, it's in my hand.</i>

634
00:56:15,459 --> 00:56:18,458
<i>The item is in my hand.
So, shall we start the work?</i>

635
00:56:18,459 --> 00:56:20,083
<i>Come, I'll call now.</i>

636
00:56:20,084 --> 00:56:21,291
<i>Come, come, come, come, come, come, come.</i>

637
00:56:21,292 --> 00:56:22,334
<i>You get in, get in!</i>

638
00:56:24,917 --> 00:56:27,792
<i>I'll take care of the cash matter,
you lock him up.</i>

639
00:56:28,042 --> 00:56:28,958
<i>I'll take care!</i>

640
00:56:28,959 --> 00:56:30,292
<i>Get on with it, son!
- Get in. - Pranchi!</i>

641
00:56:30,584 --> 00:56:33,500
<i>Don't look for anything, just go, go, go!</i>

642
00:56:33,501 --> 00:56:35,208
<i>Take hold of it!
- Come on!</i>

643
00:56:35,209 --> 00:56:37,126
<i>Let go!
- Move on!</i>

644
00:56:45,584 --> 00:56:47,084
<i>Ah, ah, got it.</i>

645
00:56:51,667 --> 00:56:54,917
<i>Wait! Hey!</i>

646
00:57:30,876 --> 00:57:31,959
<i>Hey!</i>

647
00:57:33,209 --> 00:57:34,751
<i>Stop!</i>

648
00:57:38,167 --> 00:57:39,417
<i>Hey!</i>

649
00:57:43,501 --> 00:57:44,876
<i>It is kept there, okay?</i>

650
00:57:48,792 --> 00:57:52,126
<i>Vishnu! Who are they?</i>

651
00:57:53,209 --> 00:57:56,084
<i>Hat! They took my hat, Sir.</i>

652
00:57:56,709 --> 00:57:59,083
<i>Some of them stole my hat, Sir.</i>

653
00:57:59,084 --> 00:58:00,458
<i>Hat?
- Yes.</i>

654
00:58:00,459 --> 00:58:01,876
<i>I thought it was cash.</i>

655
00:58:02,417 --> 00:58:04,042
<i>Hey, it's not cash.</i>

656
00:58:04,334 --> 00:58:08,001
<i>The manager had to
arrange for some more cash.</i>

657
00:58:08,584 --> 00:58:12,292
<i>In the meantime,
they stole the hat, Sir.</i>

658
00:58:12,459 --> 00:58:15,501
<i>All right, you go get the cash.</i>

659
00:58:15,709 --> 00:58:19,376
<i>I'll go there.
The workers are waiting there. Go.</i>

660
00:58:19,667 --> 00:58:21,417
<i>Go on!</i>

661
01:00:34,501 --> 01:00:37,541
<i>Wait up. Hey! Hey! You!</i>

662
01:00:37,542 --> 01:00:38,917
<i>Hey, listen to me.</i>

663
01:00:39,126 --> 01:00:41,042
<i>I asked you to stop.
- Come on!</i>

664
01:00:41,209 --> 01:00:42,001
<i>Back off!</i>

665
01:00:42,126 --> 01:00:43,667
<i>Spill it.
- Where is our project?</i>

666
01:00:43,917 --> 01:00:46,542
<i>Come here.
- Are you playing with our lives?</i>

667
01:00:48,334 --> 01:00:49,709
<i>'Was he waiting here?'</i>

668
01:00:52,501 --> 01:00:53,667
<i>Vishu.</i>

669
01:01:05,376 --> 01:01:07,333
<i>I've never seen an idiot like him.</i>

670
01:01:07,334 --> 01:01:10,834
<i>He doesn't trust anyone.</i>

671
01:01:11,209 --> 01:01:17,042
<i>He's the type who can make you
believe anything. Just watch.</i>

672
01:01:17,459 --> 01:01:20,292
<i>Brother, where did you go?
- I'm coming from the port.</i>

673
01:01:20,417 --> 01:01:23,500
<i>Get in, I'll drop you home.
- Who's that?</i>

674
01:01:23,501 --> 01:01:24,959
<i>Who are those guys?</i>

675
01:01:25,376 --> 01:01:26,459
<i>They're my friends.</i>

676
01:01:27,501 --> 01:01:28,792
<i>Why?
- I just asked.</i>

677
01:02:01,626 --> 01:02:02,625
<i>Hello.</i>

678
01:02:02,626 --> 01:02:04,167
<i>Hello, what's up, son?</i>

679
01:02:04,709 --> 01:02:06,417
<i>Dad, can you come near the bridge?</i>

680
01:02:06,751 --> 01:02:08,041
<i>Yes, I'll be there right away.</i>

681
01:02:08,042 --> 01:02:09,000
<i>I'll be waiting.</i>

682
01:02:09,001 --> 01:02:10,292
<i>Okay.</i>

683
01:02:19,876 --> 01:02:20,792
<i>Son!</i>

684
01:02:21,251 --> 01:02:22,417
<i>Hi, Dad.</i>

685
01:02:23,834 --> 01:02:25,041
<i>Did you eat something?</i>

686
01:02:25,042 --> 01:02:26,876
<i>Yes, I did.
What about you?</i>

687
01:02:27,126 --> 01:02:28,334
<i>I already ate.</i>

688
01:02:28,542 --> 01:02:30,166
<i>Sura!</i>

689
01:02:30,167 --> 01:02:31,917
<i>Yes, sir.
- Bring a tender coconut.</i>

690
01:02:32,042 --> 01:02:33,251
<i>You got it.</i>

691
01:02:35,042 --> 01:02:36,251
<i>Did you come early?</i>

692
01:02:36,626 --> 01:02:38,042
<i>Yes!</i>

693
01:02:39,584 --> 01:02:40,417
<i>Here you go.</i>

694
01:02:40,584 --> 01:02:41,791
<i>Have it, kid.</i>

695
01:02:41,792 --> 01:02:43,500
<i>Sura.
- Yes.</i>

696
01:02:43,501 --> 01:02:45,167
<i>Please watch the house.
- Okay.</i>

697
01:02:45,834 --> 01:02:47,459
<i>If they come home,</i>

698
01:02:47,751 --> 01:02:49,667
<i>inform me immediately.
- I will.</i>

699
01:02:58,167 --> 01:02:59,667
<i>Hmm.</i>

700
01:03:08,584 --> 01:03:11,458
<i>Son, don't worry about your mother.</i>

701
01:03:11,459 --> 01:03:15,376
<i>Once the salary starts coming from Dubai,
everything will be fine.</i>

702
01:03:15,917 --> 01:03:16,876
<i>Don't worry.</i>

703
01:03:24,334 --> 01:03:25,251
<i>Give it to him.</i>

704
01:03:28,584 --> 01:03:29,709
<i>This guy will drop
you off at the bus stop.</i>

705
01:03:30,167 --> 01:03:30,959
<i>Don't you think it's too early?
- No!</i>

706
01:03:31,084 --> 01:03:32,459
<i>It's already teatime.</i>

707
01:03:34,751 --> 01:03:35,709
<i>Get going.
- Come on!</i>

708
01:03:37,292 --> 01:03:39,376
<i>Don't worry about us.</i>

709
01:03:40,126 --> 01:03:41,167
<i>See you!</i>

710
01:03:42,251 --> 01:03:43,417
<i>Alright, dear.</i>

711
01:03:44,792 --> 01:03:45,834
<i>Shall I make a move?
- Okay.</i>

712
01:03:47,376 --> 01:03:48,542
<i>Let's go.
- Alright.</i>

713
01:03:53,751 --> 01:03:54,917
<i>See you!
- Bye.</i>

714
01:04:31,959 --> 01:04:33,126
<i>Dev, what is this?</i>

715
01:04:33,292 --> 01:04:34,125
<i>What?</i>

716
01:04:34,126 --> 01:04:35,709
<i>Where's the rest of the money?</i>

717
01:04:36,084 --> 01:04:36,916
<i>Money?
- Did you</i>

718
01:04:36,917 --> 01:04:39,792
<i>take some?
- Stop the jeep.</i>

719
01:04:40,709 --> 01:04:41,625
<i>I am talking to you.</i>

720
01:04:41,626 --> 01:04:42,501
<i>Stop the vehicle.</i>

721
01:04:42,917 --> 01:04:44,041
<i>I need the rest of the money. Stop!</i>

722
01:04:44,042 --> 01:04:44,916
<i>Come on!
- Get off me.</i>

723
01:04:44,917 --> 01:04:47,376
<i>Dev, stop!
I need the remaining amount.</i>

724
01:04:47,501 --> 01:04:48,583
<i>Get off me.</i>

725
01:04:48,584 --> 01:04:49,541
<i>Stop the vehicle!</i>

726
01:04:49,542 --> 01:04:50,708
<i>Let me drive.</i>

727
01:04:50,709 --> 01:04:52,042
<i>Where's the rest of the money?</i>

728
01:04:52,584 --> 01:04:54,459
<i>Dev, I want you to stop!</i>

729
01:04:55,042 --> 01:04:55,875
<i>Stop it.</i>

730
01:04:55,876 --> 01:04:57,666
<i>Get off me.
- Stop it!</i>

731
01:04:57,667 --> 01:04:58,459
<i>Stop behaving like this.</i>

732
01:04:58,584 --> 01:04:59,750
<i>Dev, pull over!</i>

733
01:04:59,751 --> 01:05:01,209
<i>Shut up!
- Pull over!</i>

734
01:05:01,334 --> 01:05:02,042
<i>Keep quiet!
- Pull over!</i>

735
01:05:02,167 --> 01:05:04,501
<i>You're testing my patience.
Pull over!</i>

736
01:05:04,876 --> 01:05:05,958
<i>Pull over!</i>

737
01:05:05,959 --> 01:05:08,126
<i>Can't you hear me?</i>

738
01:05:08,667 --> 01:05:09,792
<i>Get down, get down!</i>

739
01:05:09,917 --> 01:05:12,001
<i>Get down!
- Come on!</i>

740
01:05:12,376 --> 01:05:13,334
<i>Come on!</i>

741
01:05:13,459 --> 01:05:14,501
<i>The full amount isn't here.</i>

742
01:05:14,709 --> 01:05:15,709
<i>Where is the rest of the money?</i>

743
01:05:15,917 --> 01:05:16,916
<i>Where is the money?
- Come again?</i>

744
01:05:16,917 --> 01:05:19,709
<i>Did you and Vishu take
some money from this?</i>

745
01:05:20,167 --> 01:05:21,125
<i>Let me check.</i>

746
01:05:21,126 --> 01:05:22,126
<i>Hand it over!</i>

747
01:05:22,792 --> 01:05:24,625
<i>What are you doing?
- Back off!</i>

748
01:05:24,626 --> 01:05:30,126
<i>Wait up.
Don't run!</i>

749
01:05:30,501 --> 01:05:33,876
<i>Stop right there! Stop!</i>

750
01:05:38,626 --> 01:05:40,167
<i>You shameless guy.</i>

751
01:05:40,376 --> 01:05:43,334
<i>You've put your own father in debt.
How dare you suspect us?</i>

752
01:05:44,834 --> 01:05:46,917
<i>You can take this entire amount.
Just don't do anything to me.</i>

753
01:05:48,501 --> 01:05:53,083
<i>You stole 2.5 million from your
sister and even took her SIM card.</i>

754
01:05:53,084 --> 01:05:55,126
<i>And now, you're trying to
steal your father's money too?</i>

755
01:05:56,792 --> 01:05:59,084
<i>How could you be so irresponsible?</i>

756
01:05:59,792 --> 01:06:02,584
<i>My friends wouldn't do such a thing.</i>

757
01:06:03,584 --> 01:06:05,501
<i>The fake
tower business agent cheated us.</i>

758
01:06:06,584 --> 01:06:07,916
<i>My friends are honest people.</i>

759
01:06:07,917 --> 01:06:12,667
<i>Because of your friends,
your dad is in huge debt.</i>

760
01:06:13,167 --> 01:06:15,084
<i>Did you know that?</i>

761
01:06:15,334 --> 01:06:18,417
<i>They took all the money
your dad saved for you.</i>

762
01:06:19,751 --> 01:06:22,167
<i>If you want it,
you can just keep it.</i>

763
01:06:23,501 --> 01:06:24,333
<i>I want to close your chapter here.</i>

764
01:06:24,334 --> 01:06:25,501
<i>Please, don't kill me!</i>

765
01:06:26,126 --> 01:06:29,834
<i>You can decide what kind of son
you want to be for your father.</i>

766
01:06:35,334 --> 01:06:38,001
<i>Let me call them.</i>

767
01:06:45,501 --> 01:06:46,417
<i>Geez!</i>

768
01:07:53,751 --> 01:07:56,501
<i>There's no point in waiting here.</i>

769
01:07:57,292 --> 01:08:00,459
<i>We must leave immediately,
or we'll be in trouble.</i>

770
01:08:00,709 --> 01:08:01,876
<i>We are already in trouble.</i>

771
01:08:02,001 --> 01:08:03,791
<i>Why make the situation
more complicated by staying here?</i>

772
01:08:03,792 --> 01:08:10,041
<i>I have a cousin in Dubai.
Should we try going there?</i>

773
01:08:10,042 --> 01:08:12,126
<i>Dubai would be a good choice.</i>

774
01:08:12,376 --> 01:08:13,875
<i>I would like to come to Dubai too.</i>

775
01:08:13,876 --> 01:08:15,376
<i>I have lots of problems here.</i>

776
01:08:15,667 --> 01:08:18,500
<i>We can't take you with us.
The tickets are too expensive.</i>

777
01:08:18,501 --> 01:08:20,000
<i>Really? How much will it cost?</i>

778
01:08:20,001 --> 01:08:21,751
<i>Well...</i>

779
01:08:22,042 --> 01:08:23,041
<i>Just tell me.</i>

780
01:08:23,042 --> 01:08:26,000
<i>Tell him.
- It will cost at least 500,000.</i>

781
01:08:26,001 --> 01:08:27,042
<i>Really?</i>

782
01:08:27,542 --> 01:08:28,542
<i>500,000?
- Yes.</i>

783
01:08:28,876 --> 01:08:30,333
<i>If I can arrange 500,000,
will you take me along?</i>

784
01:08:30,334 --> 01:08:33,751
<i>If you can arrange the cash,
we'll definitely take you.</i>

785
01:08:34,001 --> 01:08:36,251
<i>We'll handle the business side of it.</i>

786
01:08:36,376 --> 01:08:38,125
<i>Just arrange the ticket money.</i>

787
01:08:38,126 --> 01:08:40,626
<i>What do you say?
- Yes, that would be a huge help.</i>

788
01:08:40,792 --> 01:08:42,334
<i>Are you serious?
- Yes.</i>

789
01:08:46,292 --> 01:08:48,376
<i>Let me try.
- First, arrange the money.</i>

790
01:08:48,501 --> 01:08:50,500
<i>Let me try to arrange it.
- Okay.</i>

791
01:08:50,501 --> 01:08:52,001
<i>See you!</i>

792
01:08:52,376 --> 01:08:54,167
<i>Call us once you have the money.
- Alright.</i>

793
01:08:57,667 --> 01:09:00,542
<i>I think his head is full of clay.</i>

794
01:09:02,376 --> 01:09:03,958
<i>Didn't I tell you?
- He's such a jerk.</i>

795
01:09:03,959 --> 01:09:06,000
<i>He's an idiot.
- He trusts everyone blindly.</i>

796
01:09:06,001 --> 01:09:08,167
<i>How can someone be like this?</i>

797
01:09:08,542 --> 01:09:10,542
<i>I pity his father.</i>

798
01:09:20,209 --> 01:09:22,251
<i>I have so many problems.</i>

799
01:09:22,626 --> 01:09:25,083
<i>I can't even go back home.</i>

800
01:09:25,084 --> 01:09:27,125
<i>I don't know what to do.</i>

801
01:09:27,126 --> 01:09:28,542
<i>I'm completely helpless.
- Did you hear that?</i>

802
01:09:29,751 --> 01:09:32,584
<i>My dad and sister lost
a lot of money because of me.</i>

803
01:09:33,626 --> 01:09:35,709
<i>My friends are the real culprits.</i>

804
01:09:36,126 --> 01:09:38,251
<i>The business tower agent cheated me.</i>

805
01:09:39,417 --> 01:09:44,834
<i>I have no idea what to do.
I'm a pauper now.</i>

806
01:09:46,626 --> 01:09:48,126
<i>What should I do?
- So sad, isn't it?</i>

807
01:09:48,292 --> 01:09:49,667
<i>I don't know who to trust.</i>

808
01:09:49,959 --> 01:09:51,167
<i>Ah!</i>

809
01:09:52,001 --> 01:09:54,958
<i>I feel lost.
I'm completely</i>

810
01:09:54,959 --> 01:09:56,000
<i>exhausted.</i>

811
01:09:56,001 --> 01:09:59,251
<i>You're the only ones I trust now.
- What is he talking about?</i>

812
01:10:00,084 --> 01:10:01,292
<i>Will you stand by me?</i>

813
01:10:01,709 --> 01:10:04,501
<i>You're our darling, buddy.</i>

814
01:10:06,459 --> 01:10:08,209
<i>You're our sweetheart.
- Won't you take me to Dubai?</i>

815
01:10:08,501 --> 01:10:10,334
<i>I will get the money somehow.</i>

816
01:10:10,709 --> 01:10:12,834
<i>I've told you all my problems.</i>

817
01:10:27,292 --> 01:10:29,126
<i>At the time of the wedding,</i>

818
01:10:30,501 --> 01:10:33,751
<i>the bride and groom think
they will be role models for everyone.</i>

819
01:10:35,876 --> 01:10:37,626
<i>They don't understand the challenges
of married life in that moment.</i>

820
01:10:38,792 --> 01:10:40,334
<i>Only after having kids</i>

821
01:10:41,959 --> 01:10:44,917
<i>do they understand
the dark side of married life.</i>

822
01:10:47,626 --> 01:10:51,959
<i>We don't have to prove to
people that we're a role model.</i>

823
01:10:52,667 --> 01:10:56,459
<i>We need to prove that to our children.</i>

824
01:10:58,126 --> 01:10:59,417
<i>No parent wants to be a failure</i>

825
01:11:00,709 --> 01:11:03,209
<i>in front of their children.</i>

826
01:11:10,709 --> 01:11:12,542
<i>You are not a failure.</i>

827
01:11:12,751 --> 01:11:14,001
<i>Why do you worry then?</i>

828
01:11:16,084 --> 01:11:18,042
<i>I didn't become a failure
because I had friends like you.</i>

829
01:11:19,667 --> 01:11:21,459
<i>I wanted my son to
be successful in life.</i>

830
01:11:22,542 --> 01:11:24,709
<i>I cannot bear to watch him ruin himself.</i>

831
01:11:26,126 --> 01:11:27,376
<i>Listen.</i>

832
01:11:27,667 --> 01:11:30,251
<i>Have this.</i>

833
01:11:36,334 --> 01:11:38,626
<i>I don't want anyone else
to end up in this condition.</i>

834
01:11:41,334 --> 01:11:44,833
<i>That's why I try to help
everyone who comes to me.</i>

835
01:11:44,834 --> 01:11:46,292
<i>Sir,</i>

836
01:11:47,334 --> 01:11:51,917
<i>we talked a lot today. Let's stop here.
Can you please get up?</i>

837
01:12:00,459 --> 01:12:01,792
<i>Come on!</i>

838
01:12:04,042 --> 01:12:05,042
<i>Get going.</i>

839
01:12:45,834 --> 01:12:48,667
<i>How did you manage to get the statement?
Where is it now?</i>

840
01:12:49,584 --> 01:12:53,959
<i>Answer me.
Do you want to add to the existing debt?</i>

841
01:13:01,959 --> 01:13:04,667
<i>I had kept that statement along with
the money I wanted to give to Mohan.</i>

842
01:13:05,751 --> 01:13:07,251
<i>His friends were</i>

843
01:13:08,876 --> 01:13:12,792
<i>planning to finish him off
before they went to Dubai.</i>

844
01:13:16,251 --> 01:13:20,625
<i>But how were they able to access Dad's
account and apply for the credit card?</i>

845
01:13:20,626 --> 01:13:22,417
<i>Do you know what happened that day?</i>

846
01:13:22,834 --> 01:13:23,959
<i>Over here.</i>

847
01:13:24,084 --> 01:13:24,791
<i>Pranchi,</i>

848
01:13:24,792 --> 01:13:26,084
<i>take his thumbprint.</i>

849
01:13:26,292 --> 01:13:28,709
<i>I'll take care of it. Uncle, don't worry.</i>

850
01:13:28,917 --> 01:13:30,333
<i>We already have a tie-up
with a networking company.</i>

851
01:13:30,334 --> 01:13:32,458
<i>We will figure out
something as soon as we can.</i>

852
01:13:32,459 --> 01:13:36,084
<i>We'll figure it out.
- Your money will be safe.</i>

853
01:13:36,751 --> 01:13:38,542
<i>There he is.
- Hey!</i>

854
01:13:38,751 --> 01:13:39,959
<i>Ask him about that thing.</i>

855
01:13:40,209 --> 01:13:44,376
<i>Brother, can you take them to the river?
- Sure!</i>

856
01:13:45,376 --> 01:13:47,001
<i>Who is he?
Your servant?</i>

857
01:13:47,501 --> 01:13:51,334
<i>He's my friend's son.</i>

858
01:13:51,542 --> 01:13:52,958
<i>The river is quite rough.
Let's go quickly.</i>

859
01:13:52,959 --> 01:13:54,166
<i>You can go.
I'll take care of this.</i>

860
01:13:54,167 --> 01:13:55,167
<i>Get going.
- Come on.</i>

861
01:13:56,167 --> 01:13:58,334
<i>My son took 2.5 million and absconded.</i>

862
01:13:59,501 --> 01:14:01,376
<i>I have no idea where he is.</i>

863
01:14:03,917 --> 01:14:06,167
<i>People just come and go.</i>

864
01:14:06,751 --> 01:14:09,375
<i>If I ask my daughter anything,
she will say</i>

865
01:14:09,376 --> 01:14:12,251
<i>"I just don't know,
and I don't need to know."</i>

866
01:14:14,667 --> 01:14:16,501
<i>If things continue like this,
what will I do?</i>

867
01:14:18,959 --> 01:14:22,751
<i>No one in this family has any sense
of responsibility. Including my husband.</i>

868
01:14:28,167 --> 01:14:29,834
<i>Is it too far?
- Not too far.</i>

869
01:14:30,626 --> 01:14:31,459
<i>Keep going.</i>

870
01:14:32,709 --> 01:14:34,417
<i>Do you have a cigarette?</i>

871
01:14:34,542 --> 01:14:35,709
<i>Yes, I have.</i>

872
01:14:38,167 --> 01:14:39,541
<i>This is a nice place to sit and drink.</i>

873
01:14:39,542 --> 01:14:40,917
<i>If we had known it before,
we could have brought the bottle here.</i>

874
01:14:45,501 --> 01:14:47,626
<i>Are you Mohan's college mates?</i>

875
01:14:48,084 --> 01:14:50,042
<i>Come on!</i>

876
01:14:50,751 --> 01:14:54,709
<i>Even if you sell this place,
you can't pay his college fees.</i>

877
01:14:57,501 --> 01:15:00,500
<i>But still, we've been friends
for the last six months.</i>

878
01:15:00,501 --> 01:15:01,458
<i>Nothing more than that.</i>

879
01:15:01,459 --> 01:15:03,459
<i>Once we get his dad's credit card,</i>

880
01:15:03,667 --> 01:15:04,875
<i>we need to buy a plot here.</i>

881
01:15:04,876 --> 01:15:06,209
<i>Yes, we should.</i>

882
01:15:07,709 --> 01:15:13,542
<i>It is fertile land with enough water.
Suitable for farming.</i>

883
01:15:13,834 --> 01:15:14,751
<i>Yes!</i>

884
01:15:19,001 --> 01:15:21,501
<i>Wow! It looks fantastic.</i>

885
01:15:26,876 --> 01:15:28,417
<i>Ah!</i>

886
01:15:32,709 --> 01:15:33,666
<i>Let's take a puff.</i>

887
01:15:33,667 --> 01:15:34,959
<i>Ask him if he's interested.</i>

888
01:15:35,792 --> 01:15:38,792
<i>Brother, do you want a cigarette?</i>

889
01:15:39,001 --> 01:15:41,042
<i>No.
- Fine. No pressure.</i>

890
01:15:45,209 --> 01:15:47,126
<i>Ah!</i>

891
01:15:48,459 --> 01:15:49,751
<i>Shall we get in the water?</i>

892
01:15:50,667 --> 01:15:51,626
<i>I am ready.</i>

893
01:15:51,876 --> 01:15:53,042
<i>Come on!</i>

894
01:15:54,084 --> 01:15:55,292
<i>Here you go.</i>

895
01:16:00,626 --> 01:16:05,292
<i>If we die in the water,
Pranchi will get the whole amount.</i>

896
01:16:06,251 --> 01:16:07,417
<i>That is not possible.</i>

897
01:16:11,667 --> 01:16:13,167
<i>What?</i>

898
01:16:13,959 --> 01:16:16,376
<i>Bangalore police gave him a trophy.</i>

899
01:16:16,834 --> 01:16:20,042
<i>What?
- Well, he got a trophy too.</i>

900
01:16:21,001 --> 01:16:26,209
<i>Only after getting that trophy,
he started listening to us.</i>

901
01:16:28,417 --> 01:16:29,417
<i>Huh!</i>

902
01:16:29,626 --> 01:16:31,792
<i>Come, let's get into the water.</i>

903
01:16:36,042 --> 01:16:39,416
<i>It's not deep enough to drown someone.</i>

904
01:16:39,417 --> 01:16:41,458
<i>It's pretty shallow.
- He is too young.</i>

905
01:16:41,459 --> 01:16:42,751
<i>He can't handle it alone.</i>

906
01:16:44,459 --> 01:16:45,375
<i>It's quite cold.</i>

907
01:16:45,376 --> 01:16:47,209
<i>Do you think Pranchi
must have completed his task?</i>

908
01:16:47,667 --> 01:16:49,584
<i>No idea.</i>

909
01:16:50,251 --> 01:16:51,209
<i>Check with him.</i>

910
01:16:54,084 --> 01:16:55,792
<i>Why did Achhu go to the station yesterday?</i>

911
01:16:56,334 --> 01:16:57,459
<i>What?</i>

912
01:16:58,001 --> 01:16:59,209
<i>Did Mohan tell you about it?</i>

913
01:17:02,167 --> 01:17:02,958
<i>Mohan?</i>

914
01:17:02,959 --> 01:17:04,166
<i>What are you up to?</i>

915
01:17:04,167 --> 01:17:05,125
<i>He seems curious.</i>

916
01:17:05,126 --> 01:17:06,292
<i>What is your plan?</i>

917
01:17:07,126 --> 01:17:07,958
<i>Tell me.</i>

918
01:17:07,959 --> 01:17:09,791
<i>You, worker!
- Spill the beans.</i>

919
01:17:09,792 --> 01:17:11,126
<i>What do you want?</i>

920
01:17:11,876 --> 01:17:13,042
<i>Brother!</i>

921
01:17:14,292 --> 01:17:18,001
<i>Pranchi is here.
- I am free now.</i>

922
01:17:18,209 --> 01:17:19,167
<i>Hey!</i>

923
01:17:19,876 --> 01:17:20,917
<i>Buddy!</i>

924
01:17:21,042 --> 01:17:23,209
<i>Play all three videos one by one.</i>

925
01:17:45,251 --> 01:17:47,291
<i>Shall I tell Mohan in a couple of days</i>

926
01:17:47,292 --> 01:17:49,416
<i>that you took 2.5 million
from your boss, Madan,</i>

927
01:17:49,417 --> 01:17:53,501
<i>and cheated him</i>

928
01:17:53,792 --> 01:17:57,209
<i>by investing that money in a fake company?</i>

929
01:18:00,292 --> 01:18:02,709
<i>How sad!
- Got it.</i>

930
01:18:05,042 --> 01:18:06,667
<i>He came inside.</i>

931
01:18:09,251 --> 01:18:11,417
<i>Look over there.</i>

932
01:18:12,376 --> 01:18:13,376
<i>Who is this?</i>

933
01:18:13,834 --> 01:18:14,667
<i>Hey!
- Hey!</i>

934
01:18:18,959 --> 01:18:20,001
<i>Wait.</i>

935
01:18:20,126 --> 01:18:21,833
<i>He is going inside.</i>

936
01:18:21,834 --> 01:18:23,292
<i>Oh, my!</i>

937
01:18:24,084 --> 01:18:25,292
<i>Let's go.
- What are we going to do now?</i>

938
01:18:25,917 --> 01:18:27,959
<i>Let's go.
- Geez!</i>

939
01:18:28,334 --> 01:18:29,166
<i>Buddy.</i>

940
01:18:29,167 --> 01:18:30,334
<i>Will we get into trouble?</i>

941
01:18:30,959 --> 01:18:32,291
<i>There's a possibility.</i>

942
01:18:32,292 --> 01:18:33,667
<i>Will Pranchi get caught?</i>

943
01:18:33,959 --> 01:18:36,084
<i>Why should he?
We have the footage, don't we?</i>

944
01:18:37,292 --> 01:18:39,001
<i>Let's cut it before uploading it.</i>

945
01:18:39,501 --> 01:18:40,500
<i>Good idea.</i>

946
01:18:40,501 --> 01:18:42,500
<i>And let's use that to bargain with him.
- Yes.</i>

947
01:18:42,501 --> 01:18:44,209
<i>Let's go. Why do you worry?</i>

948
01:18:44,459 --> 01:18:46,084
<i>He is feeling embarrassed now.</i>

949
01:19:02,584 --> 01:19:06,667
<i>He got promoted after calling and
complaining to whoever got him demoted.</i>

950
01:19:07,876 --> 01:19:09,542
<i>He was the one who gave us these videos.</i>

951
01:19:10,584 --> 01:19:11,959
<i>Don't worry.</i>

952
01:19:13,959 --> 01:19:15,584
<i>Call the Dubai credit card company</i>

953
01:19:15,709 --> 01:19:19,792
<i>from Dad's alternate number and
request them to block the card.</i>

954
01:19:20,501 --> 01:19:22,376
<i>We still have more work to complete.</i>

955
01:19:43,251 --> 01:19:44,041
<i>Walk faster.</i>

956
01:19:44,042 --> 01:19:46,834
<i>Keep moving.
- Someone is calling.</i>

957
01:19:47,917 --> 01:19:48,708
<i>Hey!</i>

958
01:19:48,709 --> 01:19:50,126
<i>It's your father again.</i>

959
01:19:50,459 --> 01:19:52,708
<i>Didn't I tell you to switch it off?
- Don't hang up.</i>

960
01:19:52,709 --> 01:19:54,501
<i>Why aren't you picking up my calls?</i>

961
01:19:55,917 --> 01:19:58,584
<i>Are you sure you can solve
everything by going to Dubai?</i>

962
01:19:59,042 --> 01:20:01,626
<i>We shouldn't have listened to you.
We regret it.</i>

963
01:20:02,167 --> 01:20:04,876
<i>It's because of your recklessness
that you're suffering now.</i>

964
01:20:05,626 --> 01:20:07,042
<i>Remove the SIM card from the phone.</i>

965
01:20:15,709 --> 01:20:18,126
<i>Is this a shuttle service?
- Yes.</i>

966
01:20:18,251 --> 01:20:19,334
<i>Pranchi, should we check with them?</i>

967
01:20:19,459 --> 01:20:20,916
<i>Wait for them to come.</i>

968
01:20:20,917 --> 01:20:23,041
<i>Hurry up.
- Don't you need your ticket?</i>

969
01:20:23,042 --> 01:20:24,041
<i>Isn't this our ticket?</i>

970
01:20:24,042 --> 01:20:25,292
<i>Yes, it is.</i>

971
01:20:25,667 --> 01:20:27,542
<i>I had kept it in my pocket.</i>

972
01:20:27,834 --> 01:20:29,001
<i>Here you go.</i>

973
01:20:30,376 --> 01:20:31,708
<i>You should be more careful.</i>

974
01:20:31,709 --> 01:20:34,876
<i>Sir, is this the hotel shuttle service?
- Yes.</i>

975
01:20:35,251 --> 01:20:37,583
<i>Can you please drop us off at the airport?</i>

976
01:20:37,584 --> 01:20:38,751
<i>We are worried that
we might miss our flight.</i>

977
01:20:39,042 --> 01:20:41,417
<i>We have other work to do.
- Please, sir.</i>

978
01:20:44,417 --> 01:20:45,667
<i>Get in.
- Come on!</i>

979
01:20:46,501 --> 01:20:47,376
<i>Get in.</i>

980
01:20:47,709 --> 01:20:48,541
<i>Come on!</i>

981
01:20:48,542 --> 01:20:49,751
<i>Let's put this in the trunk.</i>

982
01:20:49,876 --> 01:20:50,709
<i>In the trunk, right?</i>

983
01:20:51,501 --> 01:20:53,875
<i>Make it quick.
- Otherwise, we'll miss the flight.</i>

984
01:20:53,876 --> 01:20:55,709
<i>Wait.
- Where's the ticket?</i>

985
01:22:18,167 --> 01:22:21,751
<i>From which tree did you get this?
- From that one.</i>

986
01:22:26,542 --> 01:22:27,876
<i>This whole area belongs to you, right?</i>

987
01:22:28,917 --> 01:22:30,584
<i>The one on the other side
belongs to Vishwas, right?</i>

988
01:22:30,876 --> 01:22:34,459
<i>No, it belonged to Mathew.
But he is no more.</i>

989
01:22:35,209 --> 01:22:36,959
<i>But still, his wife gets
some income from it, right?</i>

990
01:22:37,084 --> 01:22:37,958
<i>Of course!</i>

991
01:22:37,959 --> 01:22:39,209
<i>Huh!</i>

992
01:22:40,209 --> 01:22:41,417
<i>Sura, come here.</i>

993
01:22:46,959 --> 01:22:48,084
<i>Take this money.</i>

994
01:22:54,042 --> 01:22:55,084
<i>Do one thing.</i>

995
01:22:55,292 --> 01:22:57,208
<i>Give this money to his wife
for the tender coconuts. - Sure!</i>

996
01:22:57,209 --> 01:22:58,376
<i>Bring back the change.
- I'll be right back.</i>

997
01:22:58,542 --> 01:22:59,751
<i>Get going.</i>

998
01:23:02,709 --> 01:23:04,459
<i>There is a letter for you, sir.</i>

999
01:23:22,917 --> 01:23:24,376
<i>Why is this vehicle here?</i>

1000
01:23:24,626 --> 01:23:27,876
<i>My hands are dirty.
Can you please read it for me?</i>

1001
01:23:28,292 --> 01:23:29,250
<i>All right, should I open it?</i>

1002
01:23:29,251 --> 01:23:30,376
<i>Please.</i>

1003
01:23:49,084 --> 01:23:50,458
<i>This is from Dubai,
United Arab Emirates.</i>

1004
01:23:50,459 --> 01:23:51,584
<i>Did you apply for a credit card?</i>

1005
01:23:52,042 --> 01:23:54,084
<i>It's from my son, right?
- Yes!</i>

1006
01:24:08,251 --> 01:24:09,625
<i>They have sent you a notice</i>

1007
01:24:09,626 --> 01:24:12,042
<i>asking you to pay 1.5 million.</i>

1008
01:24:14,834 --> 01:24:19,459
<i>1.5 million? I retired long ago.</i>

1009
01:24:22,126 --> 01:24:25,459
<i>1.5 million dirhams is
roughly four crore rupees.</i>

1010
01:24:26,959 --> 01:24:28,417
<i>Four crores?</i>

1011
01:24:31,751 --> 01:24:33,042
<i>Yes.</i>

1012
01:24:34,417 --> 01:24:35,209
<i>I...</i>

1013
01:24:36,126 --> 01:24:39,251
<i>Sir, you will have to sign some papers.
Can you come with me?</i>

1014
01:24:41,042 --> 01:24:42,376
<i>Four crores!</i>

1015
01:24:43,251 --> 01:24:44,126
<i>Sir!</i>

1016
01:24:44,417 --> 01:24:45,251
<i>Come on.
- Sure!</i>

1017
01:24:45,751 --> 01:24:46,667
<i>Just a minute.</i>

1018
01:24:48,167 --> 01:24:51,459
<i>How is that possible?
Four crores?</i>

1019
01:24:53,084 --> 01:24:55,042
<i>How did that happen?</i>

1020
01:25:22,917 --> 01:25:23,959
<i>Sir,</i>

1021
01:25:32,709 --> 01:25:33,667
<i>I need your signature on this.</i>

1022
01:26:02,959 --> 01:26:04,584
<i>Is Achyutha at home?</i>

1023
01:26:05,251 --> 01:26:07,542
<i>Why? What happened?</i>

1024
01:26:08,292 --> 01:26:09,459
<i>Can't I receive this notice?</i>

1025
01:26:09,709 --> 01:26:12,251
<i>These are RTI documents.
I need to give them to the person concerned.</i>

1026
01:26:13,959 --> 01:26:15,209
<i>All right.</i>

1027
01:26:20,876 --> 01:26:21,959
<i>See you then.</i>

1028
01:27:02,584 --> 01:27:08,584
<i>Vishnukutti, why are you so lazy?
Go and have something.</i>

1029
01:27:12,667 --> 01:27:13,876
<i>Are you mad at me?</i>

1030
01:27:15,542 --> 01:27:19,792
<i>Eat it. Didn't I bring
this for you in the morning?</i>

1031
01:27:20,042 --> 01:27:22,626
<i>But you didn't eat it.
The same applies to you.</i>

1032
01:27:25,126 --> 01:27:27,501
<i>You're my sweetheart, aren't you?</i>

1033
01:28:30,584 --> 01:28:31,501
<i>Madam.</i>

1034
01:28:31,876 --> 01:28:32,501
<i>Yes.
- Madam.</i>

1035
01:28:32,959 --> 01:28:34,001
<i>Just a minute.</i>

1036
01:28:36,751 --> 01:28:37,709
<i>Tell me.</i>

1037
01:28:37,917 --> 01:28:39,001
<i>You have a letter.</i>

1038
01:28:41,459 --> 01:28:42,292
<i>Please sign here.</i>

1039
01:28:43,667 --> 01:28:44,626
<i>Pen, please.</i>

1040
01:28:44,751 --> 01:28:45,959
<i>Here you go!</i>

1041
01:28:59,751 --> 01:29:00,834
<i>What was in the letter?</i>

1042
01:29:02,209 --> 01:29:03,251
<i>Nothing serious.</i>

1043
01:29:04,084 --> 01:29:06,042
<i>Since it's related to money,
I want to know about it.</i>

1044
01:29:07,417 --> 01:29:10,001
<i>You need to pay four
crores within seven days.</i>

1045
01:29:11,209 --> 01:29:14,292
<i>If you don't, they will take legal action.</i>

1046
01:29:32,084 --> 01:29:33,209
<i>Thank you!</i>

1047
01:29:33,501 --> 01:29:34,709
<i>I'll pick it up.</i>

1048
01:29:53,251 --> 01:29:58,501
<i>Achhu, ask Dad to get
everything we need for tomorrow's Onam.</i>

1049
01:30:29,042 --> 01:30:30,417
<i>Okay.</i>

1050
01:30:32,417 --> 01:30:34,000
<i>Tell me.</i>

1051
01:30:34,001 --> 01:30:36,084
<i>Hello.</i>

1052
01:30:44,167 --> 01:30:45,501
<i>Dad, I...</i>

1053
01:30:46,334 --> 01:30:47,792
<i>I got a job.</i>

1054
01:30:48,792 --> 01:30:50,125
<i>Really, dear?</i>

1055
01:30:50,126 --> 01:30:51,542
<i>Yes, Dad.</i>

1056
01:30:52,959 --> 01:30:55,417
<i>In the Central Government's
R and I Department.</i>

1057
01:30:57,376 --> 01:30:59,709
<i>Where are you, Dad?</i>

1058
01:31:04,709 --> 01:31:08,584
<i>Will you come home early? Mom asked you
to get the things needed for the pooja.</i>

1059
01:31:12,709 --> 01:31:14,042
<i>I'll be there in a while.</i>

1060
01:32:56,751 --> 01:33:00,001
<i>They deceived me, Dad.</i>

1061
01:33:06,084 --> 01:33:08,792
<i>After I saw you receiving
the letter from the postman,</i>

1062
01:33:10,042 --> 01:33:13,417
<i>I called them once again.</i>

1063
01:33:18,417 --> 01:33:20,084
<i>Please forgive me.</i>

1064
01:34:06,542 --> 01:34:07,459
<i>How much is this ticket?</i>

1065
01:34:07,667 --> 01:34:08,667
<i>Fifty rupees.
- Okay.</i>

1066
01:34:08,792 --> 01:34:09,459
<i>Is it a bumper?</i>

1067
01:34:09,792 --> 01:34:11,458
<i>This one is the bumper.</i>

1068
01:34:11,459 --> 01:34:12,666
<i>This one.
- This is the Karunya ticket.</i>

1069
01:34:12,667 --> 01:34:13,334
<i>I can sell it only tomorrow.</i>

1070
01:34:13,709 --> 01:34:14,333
<i>You can take this one.</i>

1071
01:34:14,334 --> 01:34:15,542
<i>How much is this?
- 400 rupees.</i>

1072
01:34:16,792 --> 01:34:19,626
<i>That's a set of twelve.
It will cost you 600 rupees.</i>

1073
01:34:20,542 --> 01:34:21,542
<i>Here you go.</i>

1074
01:34:24,501 --> 01:34:25,041
<i>Change.</i>

1075
01:34:25,042 --> 01:34:25,792
<i>Okay.</i>

1076
01:34:26,209 --> 01:34:28,917
<i>Take this. Someone got 5000
for buying that 64-rupee ticket.</i>

1077
01:34:29,584 --> 01:34:30,709
<i>There are twelve in a set.</i>

1078
01:34:33,917 --> 01:34:41,291
<i>Mesmerising moon.</i>

1079
01:34:41,292 --> 01:34:46,126
<i>I really like your brightness,
O Chandralekha!</i>

1080
01:34:46,417 --> 01:34:47,709
<i>Sura.
- Yes.</i>

1081
01:34:47,917 --> 01:34:49,500
<i>Can you please deliver
these items to my home?</i>

1082
01:34:49,501 --> 01:34:51,375
<i>Sure, I will.</i>

1083
01:34:51,376 --> 01:34:53,167
<i>You seem to be drunk.</i>

1084
01:34:56,459 --> 01:34:57,667
<i>Not that way.</i>

1085
01:34:59,251 --> 01:35:00,041
<i>This way.
- Oh!</i>

1086
01:35:00,042 --> 01:35:01,625
<i>You're right.</i>

1087
01:35:01,626 --> 01:35:03,501
<i>He doesn't even know which side to go.</i>

1088
01:35:03,959 --> 01:35:05,042
<i>Hey!</i>

1089
01:35:06,459 --> 01:35:09,751
<i>Where's the balance?
I spent a hundred rupees.</i>

1090
01:35:10,834 --> 01:35:12,251
<i>Remaining 180 rupees...</i>

1091
01:35:14,667 --> 01:35:16,084
<i>The balance is 250 rupees.</i>

1092
01:35:16,376 --> 01:35:20,834
<i>I spent it on a bumper.
No, I've kept it inside.</i>

1093
01:35:30,667 --> 01:35:31,583
<i>Mohan,</i>

1094
01:35:31,584 --> 01:35:33,667
<i>[Indistinct chatter]</i>

1095
01:35:34,251 --> 01:35:35,209
<i>I'm planning to</i>

1096
